window.IELTS_TOPIC={"topic":9,"en":"The Industrial Revolution & History of Inventions","zh":"工業革命與發明史","items":[{"w":"steam engine","pos":"n.","def":"a machine that uses steam to make power","cn":"蒸汽機","s":"James Watt improved the ________ in the 1760s, and factories soon used his design to run their machines.","zh":"詹姆斯·瓦特在1760年代改良了蒸汽機,而工廠很快就用他的設計來運轉機器。","part":"A","sec":"Steam Power & Engines 蒸汽動力與引擎","lab":"A1","t":"蒸汽機"},{"w":"boiler","pos":"n.","def":"a large container where water is heated into steam","cn":"鍋爐","s":"The workers filled the ________ with water every morning, but they had to watch it carefully because it could explode.","zh":"工人們每天早上把鍋爐裝滿水,但他們必須小心看著它,因為它可能會爆炸。","part":"A","sec":"Steam Power & Engines 蒸汽動力與引擎","lab":"A2","t":"鍋爐"},{"w":"piston","pos":"n.","def":"a part that moves up and down inside a tube in an engine","cn":"活塞","s":"The steam pushed the ________ up and down, and this movement turned the big wheel of the machine.","zh":"蒸汽推動活塞上下移動,而這個動作帶動了機器的大輪子轉動。","part":"A","sec":"Steam Power & Engines 蒸汽動力與引擎","lab":"A3","t":"活塞"},{"w":"cylinder","pos":"n.","def":"a tube-shaped part of an engine where a piston moves","cn":"汽缸","s":"Our science teacher showed us a model of an old engine, and we could see the piston moving inside the ________.","zh":"我們的自然老師給我們看了一台舊引擎的模型,而我們可以看到活塞在汽缸裡移動。","part":"A","sec":"Steam Power & Engines 蒸汽動力與引擎","lab":"A4","t":"汽缸"},{"w":"valve","pos":"n.","def":"a part that opens and closes to control gas or liquid","cn":"閥門","s":"The engineer opened the ________ slowly, so the extra steam could escape safely from the old engine.","zh":"工程師慢慢打開閥門,好讓多餘的蒸汽能安全地從舊引擎中排出。","part":"A","sec":"Steam Power & Engines 蒸汽動力與引擎","lab":"A5","t":"閥門"},{"w":"furnace","pos":"n.","def":"a very hot enclosed fire used to heat or melt things","cn":"熔爐;火爐","s":"The men shovelled coal into the ________ all day, and their faces were always black with dust.","zh":"那些男人整天把煤鏟進熔爐裡,而他們的臉總是被灰塵弄得黑黑的。","part":"A","sec":"Steam Power & Engines 蒸汽動力與引擎","lab":"A6","t":"熔爐"},{"w":"flywheel","pos":"n.","def":"a heavy wheel that keeps a machine turning smoothly","cn":"飛輪","s":"The heavy ________ kept spinning after the steam stopped, so the machine did not suddenly jerk to a halt.","zh":"蒸汽停止後,沉重的飛輪仍持續轉動,所以機器不會突然猛地停下來。","part":"A","sec":"Steam Power & Engines 蒸汽動力與引擎","lab":"A7","t":"飛輪"},{"w":"crankshaft","pos":"n.","def":"a rod in an engine that turns up-and-down movement into turning","cn":"曲軸","s":"The mechanic said the ________ in my grandfather's old car was broken, and fixing it would cost a lot of money.","zh":"技師說我祖父那輛舊車的曲軸壞了,而修理它要花很多錢。","part":"A","sec":"Steam Power & Engines 蒸汽動力與引擎","lab":"A8","t":"曲軸"},{"w":"horsepower","pos":"n.","def":"a unit for measuring the power of an engine","cn":"馬力","s":"Early cars had only a few ________, but people were still amazed because they did not need horses at all.","zh":"早期的汽車只有幾匹馬力,但人們仍然很驚訝,因為它們完全不需要馬。","part":"A","sec":"Steam Power & Engines 蒸汽動力與引擎","lab":"A9","t":"匹馬力"},{"w":"coal-fired","pos":"adj.","def":"using coal as the fuel to produce heat or power","cn":"燃煤的","s":"The town had a large ________ power station, and on windy days the smoke drifted over our school.","zh":"這個鎮上有一座大型燃煤發電廠,而在颳風的日子,煙會飄到我們學校上空。","part":"A","sec":"Steam Power & Engines 蒸汽動力與引擎","lab":"A10","t":"燃煤"},{"w":"steam-powered","pos":"adj.","def":"driven by the power of steam","cn":"蒸汽動力的","s":"The museum still runs a ________ printing machine on weekends, and children love watching it work.","zh":"博物館在週末仍會運轉一台蒸汽動力的印刷機,而孩子們很喜歡看它運作。","part":"A","sec":"Steam Power & Engines 蒸汽動力與引擎","lab":"A11","t":"蒸汽動力的"},{"w":"condenser","pos":"n.","def":"a part that cools steam and turns it back into water","cn":"冷凝器","s":"Watt added a separate ________ to the engine, so it wasted much less coal than older designs.","zh":"瓦特在引擎上加了一個獨立的冷凝器,所以它比舊設計浪費的煤少得多。","part":"A","sec":"Steam Power & Engines 蒸汽動力與引擎","lab":"A12","t":"冷凝器"},{"w":"chimney","pos":"n.","def":"a tall pipe that carries smoke up and out of a building","cn":"煙囪","s":"Hundreds of tall ________ rose above the city, and thick black smoke poured out of them day and night.","zh":"數以百計高高的煙囪聳立在城市上方,而濃濃的黑煙日夜從裡面冒出來。","part":"A","sec":"Steam Power & Engines 蒸汽動力與引擎","lab":"A13","t":"煙囪"},{"w":"water wheel","pos":"n.","def":"a large wheel turned by flowing water to power machines","cn":"水車","s":"Before steam engines, many mills were built next to rivers because they needed a ______ ______ for power.","zh":"在蒸汽機出現之前,許多磨坊都建在河邊,因為它們需要水車來提供動力。","part":"A","sec":"Steam Power & Engines 蒸汽動力與引擎","lab":"A14","t":"水車"},{"w":"windmill","pos":"n.","def":"a building with sails that the wind turns to make power","cn":"風車","s":"The old ________ on the hill once ground wheat into flour, but now it is a popular spot for photos.","zh":"山丘上那座古老的風車曾經把小麥磨成麵粉,但現在它是熱門的拍照景點。","part":"A","sec":"Steam Power & Engines 蒸汽動力與引擎","lab":"A15","t":"風車"},{"w":"turbine","pos":"n.","def":"a machine with blades that spin to produce power","cn":"渦輪機","s":"Steam flows through the ________ at high speed, and the spinning blades help produce electricity for the city.","zh":"蒸汽高速流過渦輪機,而旋轉的葉片幫助為城市產生電力。","part":"A","sec":"Steam Power & Engines 蒸汽動力與引擎","lab":"A16","t":"渦輪機"},{"w":"dynamo","pos":"n.","def":"a machine that turns movement into electricity","cn":"發電機(直流)","s":"My bike has a small ________ on the front wheel, so the light comes on when I pedal at night.","zh":"我的腳踏車前輪上有一個小發電機,所以晚上我踩踏板時燈就會亮。","part":"A","sec":"Steam Power & Engines 蒸汽動力與引擎","lab":"A17","t":"發電機"},{"w":"generator","pos":"n.","def":"a machine that produces electricity","cn":"發電機","s":"The power went off during the storm, but the hospital switched on its ________ and kept working.","zh":"暴風雨期間停電了,但醫院啟動了發電機並持續運作。","part":"A","sec":"Steam Power & Engines 蒸汽動力與引擎","lab":"A18","t":"發電機"},{"w":"electricity","pos":"n.","def":"a form of energy used for light, heat and machines","cn":"電;電力","s":"Before ________ reached their village, families used oil lamps at night, and children did homework by candlelight.","zh":"在電力到達他們的村莊之前,家家戶戶晚上用油燈,而孩子們在燭光下寫功課。","part":"A","sec":"Steam Power & Engines 蒸汽動力與引擎","lab":"A19","t":"電力"},{"w":"voltage","pos":"n.","def":"the force of an electric current, measured in volts","cn":"電壓","s":"You should check the ________ before you plug in your hair dryer abroad, or it may burn out.","zh":"在國外插上吹風機之前你應該檢查電壓,否則它可能會燒壞。","part":"A","sec":"Steam Power & Engines 蒸汽動力與引擎","lab":"A20","t":"電壓"},{"w":"vapour","pos":"n.","def":"tiny drops of water or other liquid in the air","cn":"蒸氣;水氣","s":"When the kettle boiled, white ________ rose into the cold kitchen, and the windows quickly became cloudy.","zh":"水壺燒開時,白色的蒸氣升進寒冷的廚房,而窗戶很快就變得霧濛濛的。","part":"A","sec":"Steam Power & Engines 蒸汽動力與引擎","lab":"A21","t":"蒸氣"},{"w":"internal combustion engine","pos":"n.phr.","def":"an engine that burns fuel inside it to make power","cn":"內燃機","s":"The ______ ______ ______ made cars lighter and faster, so steam cars slowly disappeared from the roads.","zh":"內燃機讓汽車更輕更快,所以蒸汽車慢慢從道路上消失了。","part":"A","sec":"Steam Power & Engines 蒸汽動力與引擎","lab":"A22","t":"內燃機"},{"w":"spark plug","pos":"n.","def":"a small part that makes a spark to light fuel in an engine","cn":"火星塞","s":"My motorbike would not start this morning, and the mechanic said the ______ ______ needed to be replaced.","zh":"我的機車今天早上發不動,而技師說火星塞需要更換。","part":"A","sec":"Steam Power & Engines 蒸汽動力與引擎","lab":"A23","t":"火星塞"},{"w":"overheat","pos":"v.","def":"to become too hot","cn":"過熱","s":"The old engine began to ________ on the steep hill, so we stopped and waited for it to cool down.","zh":"那台舊引擎在陡坡上開始過熱,所以我們停下來等它冷卻。","part":"A","sec":"Steam Power & Engines 蒸汽動力與引擎","lab":"A24","t":"過熱"},{"w":"lubricate","pos":"v.","def":"to put oil on parts so they move smoothly","cn":"潤滑;上油","s":"Workers had to ________ the moving parts every day, because dry metal wore out very quickly.","zh":"工人們每天都必須潤滑那些移動的零件,因為乾燥的金屬磨損得很快。","part":"A","sec":"Steam Power & Engines 蒸汽動力與引擎","lab":"A25","t":"潤滑"},{"w":"rust","pos":"v.","def":"to become covered with a reddish layer when iron gets wet","cn":"生鏽","s":"My dad left his tools outside in the rain, and after a week they began to ________ badly.","zh":"我爸把他的工具留在外面淋雨,而一週後它們開始嚴重生鏽。","part":"A","sec":"Steam Power & Engines 蒸汽動力與引擎","lab":"A26","t":"生鏽"},{"w":"pump","pos":"n.","def":"a machine that pushes liquid or air in or out","cn":"幫浦;抽水機","s":"Water kept flooding the mine, so the owners bought a steam ________ to remove it day and night.","zh":"水不斷淹進礦坑,所以礦主買了一台蒸汽抽水機日夜把水抽出。","part":"A","sec":"Steam Power & Engines 蒸汽動力與引擎","lab":"A27","t":"抽水機"},{"w":"stoke","pos":"v.","def":"to add fuel to a fire and keep it burning strongly","cn":"添加燃料;撥旺(火)","s":"On the old steam train, one man had to ________ the fire all the time, while the driver watched the track.","zh":"在那列老蒸汽火車上,一個人必須一直添煤撥火,而司機則盯著鐵軌。","part":"A","sec":"Steam Power & Engines 蒸汽動力與引擎","lab":"A28","t":"添煤撥火"},{"w":"power station","pos":"n.","def":"a place where electricity is produced","cn":"發電廠","s":"The new ______ ______ supplies electricity to the whole county, but some residents worry about the noise.","zh":"新的發電廠供電給整個郡,但一些居民擔心噪音問題。","part":"A","sec":"Steam Power & Engines 蒸汽動力與引擎","lab":"A29","t":"發電廠"},{"w":"factory","pos":"n.","def":"a building where goods are made in large numbers by machines","cn":"工廠","s":"My aunt works in a shoe ________ near the harbour, and she often has to work late before the holidays.","zh":"我阿姨在港口附近的一家鞋子工廠工作,而假期前她經常得加班。","part":"A","sec":"Factories, Mills & Textiles 工廠、磨坊與紡織","lab":"A30","t":"工廠"},{"w":"mill","pos":"n.","def":"a building with machines for making cloth or flour","cn":"磨坊;紡織廠","s":"The cotton ________ employed over a thousand people, but the noise of the machines was almost unbearable.","zh":"那家棉紡廠雇用了一千多人,但機器的噪音幾乎令人無法忍受。","part":"A","sec":"Factories, Mills & Textiles 工廠、磨坊與紡織","lab":"A31","t":"廠"},{"w":"cotton","pos":"n.","def":"a soft white plant fibre used to make cloth","cn":"棉花;棉","s":"Britain imported huge amounts of raw ________, and its factories turned it into cheap cloth for the world.","zh":"英國進口了大量的原棉,而它的工廠把棉花製成便宜的布料賣到全世界。","part":"A","sec":"Factories, Mills & Textiles 工廠、磨坊與紡織","lab":"A32","t":"棉"},{"w":"wool","pos":"n.","def":"the soft hair of sheep, used to make cloth","cn":"羊毛","s":"My grandmother knitted me a scarf from thick ________, and it keeps me warm on cold winter mornings.","zh":"我奶奶用厚厚的羊毛為我織了一條圍巾,而它讓我在寒冷的冬天早晨保持溫暖。","part":"A","sec":"Factories, Mills & Textiles 工廠、磨坊與紡織","lab":"A33","t":"羊毛"},{"w":"spinning wheel","pos":"n.","def":"a simple machine for making thread at home","cn":"紡車","s":"Before factories, women made thread at home on a ______ ______, but it took many hours to make enough.","zh":"在工廠出現之前,婦女們在家用紡車紡線,但要花好幾個小時才能做出足夠的線。","part":"A","sec":"Factories, Mills & Textiles 工廠、磨坊與紡織","lab":"A34","t":"紡車"},{"w":"spinning jenny","pos":"n.","def":"an early machine that spun many threads at once","cn":"珍妮紡紗機","s":"The ______ ______ could spin eight threads at once, so one worker could do the job of eight people.","zh":"珍妮紡紗機一次可以紡八條線,所以一個工人就能做八個人的工作。","part":"A","sec":"Factories, Mills & Textiles 工廠、磨坊與紡織","lab":"A35","t":"珍妮紡紗機"},{"w":"power loom","pos":"n.","def":"a machine driven by power for weaving cloth","cn":"動力織布機","s":"The ______ ______ wove cloth much faster than hand weavers, and many of them lost their jobs.","zh":"動力織布機織布比手工織工快得多,而他們之中許多人因此失業。","part":"A","sec":"Factories, Mills & Textiles 工廠、磨坊與紡織","lab":"A36","t":"動力織布機"},{"w":"yarn","pos":"n.","def":"long thread used for knitting or weaving","cn":"紗線;毛線","s":"She bought some bright red ________ at the market, and she plans to knit a hat for her little brother.","zh":"她在市場買了一些鮮紅色的毛線,而她打算為弟弟織一頂帽子。","part":"A","sec":"Factories, Mills & Textiles 工廠、磨坊與紡織","lab":"A37","t":"毛線"},{"w":"thread","pos":"n.","def":"a long thin string of cotton or other material used for sewing","cn":"線","s":"The button on my coat fell off, so my mother sewed it back on with some black ________.","zh":"我外套上的鈕扣掉了,所以我媽媽用一些黑色的線把它縫回去。","part":"A","sec":"Factories, Mills & Textiles 工廠、磨坊與紡織","lab":"A38","t":"線"},{"w":"spindle","pos":"n.","def":"a thin rod on which thread is wound when it is spun","cn":"紡錘;錠子","s":"Each machine had hundreds of ________ turning at once, and children had to fix the broken threads quickly.","zh":"每台機器上有數百個錠子同時轉動,而孩子們必須迅速接好斷掉的線。","part":"A","sec":"Factories, Mills & Textiles 工廠、磨坊與紡織","lab":"A39","t":"錠子"},{"w":"cloth","pos":"n.","def":"material made by weaving cotton, wool or other fibres","cn":"布;布料","s":"The tailor measured me carefully, and then he cut the dark blue ________ to make my school uniform.","zh":"裁縫仔細幫我量尺寸,然後他剪裁深藍色的布料來做我的校服。","part":"A","sec":"Factories, Mills & Textiles 工廠、磨坊與紡織","lab":"A40","t":"布料"},{"w":"garment","pos":"n.","def":"a piece of clothing","cn":"衣服;服裝","s":"Every ________ in this shop is made from recycled material, but the prices are still quite reasonable.","zh":"這家店的每一件衣服都是用回收材料做的,但價格仍相當合理。","part":"A","sec":"Factories, Mills & Textiles 工廠、磨坊與紡織","lab":"A41","t":"衣服"},{"w":"sewing machine","pos":"n.","def":"a machine for joining cloth with thread","cn":"縫紉機","s":"My mum bought an old ______ ______ online, and now she makes curtains and bags for the whole family.","zh":"我媽媽在網路上買了一台舊縫紉機,而現在她為全家人做窗簾和袋子。","part":"A","sec":"Factories, Mills & Textiles 工廠、磨坊與紡織","lab":"A42","t":"縫紉機"},{"w":"weaver","pos":"n.","def":"a person who makes cloth by crossing threads on a loom","cn":"織工;織布工","s":"The village ________ worked at home for centuries, but factory machines soon took away their income.","zh":"村裡的織工幾世紀以來都在家工作,但工廠的機器很快就奪走了他們的收入。","part":"A","sec":"Factories, Mills & Textiles 工廠、磨坊與紡織","lab":"A43","t":"織工"},{"w":"cottage industry","pos":"n.phr.","def":"work done by people in their own homes","cn":"家庭手工業","s":"Making lace was once a ______ ______ in this area, and many families earned extra money from it.","zh":"製作蕾絲曾經是這個地區的家庭手工業,而許多家庭藉此賺取額外收入。","part":"A","sec":"Factories, Mills & Textiles 工廠、磨坊與紡織","lab":"A44","t":"家庭手工業"},{"w":"workshop","pos":"n.","def":"a room or building where things are made or repaired","cn":"工作坊;作坊","s":"Grandpa spends every afternoon in his ________, and he has built three wooden chairs this year.","zh":"爺爺每天下午都待在他的工作坊裡,而他今年已經做了三張木椅。","part":"A","sec":"Factories, Mills & Textiles 工廠、磨坊與紡織","lab":"A45","t":"工作坊"},{"w":"foreman","pos":"n.","def":"a worker who is in charge of a group of other workers","cn":"工頭;領班","s":"The ________ shouted at the boys to work faster, but they were too tired after twelve hours.","zh":"工頭對著男孩們大吼要他們做快一點,但工作十二小時後他們已經太累了。","part":"A","sec":"Factories, Mills & Textiles 工廠、磨坊與紡織","lab":"A46","t":"工頭"},{"w":"mechanise","pos":"v.","def":"to start using machines to do work","cn":"使機械化","s":"Farmers began to ________ their work in the 1800s, so fewer people were needed in the fields.","zh":"農民在1800年代開始讓工作機械化,所以田裡需要的人手變少了。","part":"A","sec":"Factories, Mills & Textiles 工廠、磨坊與紡織","lab":"A47","t":"機械化"},{"w":"mechanisation","pos":"n.","def":"the use of machines to replace human or animal work","cn":"機械化","s":"________ made cloth much cheaper, but it also caused many skilled workers to lose their jobs.","zh":"機械化讓布料便宜很多,但也導致許多熟練工人失去工作。","part":"A","sec":"Factories, Mills & Textiles 工廠、磨坊與紡織","lab":"A48","t":"機械化"},{"w":"mill owner","pos":"n.","def":"a person who owns a factory or mill","cn":"工廠主;磨坊主","s":"The rich ______ ______ built houses for his workers, while other owners did not care where workers lived.","zh":"那位富有的工廠主為他的工人蓋了房子,而其他工廠主並不在乎工人住在哪裡。","part":"A","sec":"Factories, Mills & Textiles 工廠、磨坊與紡織","lab":"A49","t":"工廠主"},{"w":"raw material","pos":"n.","def":"a natural substance used to make products","cn":"原料","s":"Cotton was the main ______ ______ for the mills, so ships brought it across the ocean every week.","zh":"棉花是工廠的主要原料,所以船隻每週都把它運過大洋。","part":"A","sec":"Factories, Mills & Textiles 工廠、磨坊與紡織","lab":"A50","t":"原料"},{"w":"finished goods","pos":"n.","def":"products that are ready to be sold","cn":"成品","s":"The factory turned cotton into ______ ______, and trains carried them to shops all over the country.","zh":"工廠把棉花變成成品,而火車把它們運到全國各地的商店。","part":"A","sec":"Factories, Mills & Textiles 工廠、磨坊與紡織","lab":"A51","t":"成品"},{"w":"manufacturer","pos":"n.","def":"a company that makes goods in large amounts","cn":"製造商","s":"This toy ________ moved its factory to another country, because the costs there were much lower.","zh":"這家玩具製造商把工廠遷到另一個國家,因為那裡的成本低得多。","part":"A","sec":"Factories, Mills & Textiles 工廠、磨坊與紡織","lab":"A52","t":"製造商"},{"w":"workbench","pos":"n.","def":"a strong table used for making or repairing things","cn":"工作檯","s":"He laid all the clock parts on the ________, and he slowly put them back together one by one.","zh":"他把所有的時鐘零件攤在工作檯上,然後慢慢地一個一個把它們組裝回去。","part":"A","sec":"Factories, Mills & Textiles 工廠、磨坊與紡織","lab":"A53","t":"工作檯"},{"w":"artisan","pos":"n.","def":"a skilled person who makes things by hand","cn":"工匠;手藝人","s":"This market sells bread from a local ________, and people queue early because it sells out fast.","zh":"這個市場販售當地一位手藝人做的麵包,而人們很早就排隊,因為很快就賣光了。","part":"A","sec":"Factories, Mills & Textiles 工廠、磨坊與紡織","lab":"A54","t":"手藝人"},{"w":"handmade","pos":"adj.","def":"made by hand, not by machine","cn":"手工製作的","s":"Her ________ pottery is more expensive than factory cups, but every piece has its own special pattern.","zh":"她手工製作的陶器比工廠做的杯子貴,但每一件都有自己獨特的圖案。","part":"A","sec":"Factories, Mills & Textiles 工廠、磨坊與紡織","lab":"A55","t":"手工製作的"},{"w":"machine-made","pos":"adj.","def":"produced by a machine, not by hand","cn":"機器製造的","s":"________ socks were much cheaper than knitted ones, so poor families could finally afford new clothes.","zh":"機器製造的襪子比手織的便宜很多,所以貧窮的家庭終於買得起新衣服。","part":"A","sec":"Factories, Mills & Textiles 工廠、磨坊與紡織","lab":"A56","t":"機器製造的"},{"w":"cotton gin","pos":"n.","def":"a machine that separates cotton fibres from seeds","cn":"軋棉機","s":"The ______ ______ cleaned cotton very quickly, but sadly it also increased the demand for slave labour.","zh":"軋棉機能很快地清理棉花,但可悲的是它也增加了對奴隸勞動的需求。","part":"A","sec":"Factories, Mills & Textiles 工廠、磨坊與紡織","lab":"A57","t":"軋棉機"},{"w":"interchangeable parts","pos":"n.phr.","def":"identical parts that can replace each other easily","cn":"可互換零件","s":"Guns made with ______ ______ were easy to repair, because a broken piece could simply be swapped.","zh":"用可互換零件製造的槍很容易修理,因為壞掉的零件只要直接換掉就好。","part":"A","sec":"Factories, Mills & Textiles 工廠、磨坊與紡織","lab":"A58","t":"可互換零件"},{"w":"coal mine","pos":"n.","def":"a place underground where coal is dug out","cn":"煤礦","s":"My great-grandfather worked in a ______ ______ when he was only twelve, and he rarely saw the sun in winter.","zh":"我曾祖父十二歲時就在煤礦工作,而他在冬天很少見到太陽。","part":"A","sec":"Mining, Iron & Steel 採礦與鋼鐵","lab":"A59","t":"煤礦"},{"w":"colliery","pos":"n.","def":"a coal mine and the buildings around it","cn":"煤礦場","s":"The ________ closed in 1985, and many families in the valley had to move away to find work.","zh":"那座煤礦場在1985年關閉了,而山谷裡的許多家庭必須搬走去找工作。","part":"A","sec":"Mining, Iron & Steel 採礦與鋼鐵","lab":"A60","t":"煤礦場"},{"w":"miner","pos":"n.","def":"a person who works under the ground digging coal or metal","cn":"礦工","s":"The ________ went down into the dark tunnels every morning, and their families waited nervously for them.","zh":"礦工們每天早上下到黑暗的坑道裡,而他們的家人緊張地等著他們回來。","part":"A","sec":"Mining, Iron & Steel 採礦與鋼鐵","lab":"A61","t":"礦工"},{"w":"mine shaft","pos":"n.","def":"a deep hole going down into a mine","cn":"礦井","s":"The workers rode a small lift down the ______ ______, and the air grew hotter as they went deeper.","zh":"工人們乘坐小升降機沿著礦井下去,而越往深處空氣就越熱。","part":"A","sec":"Mining, Iron & Steel 採礦與鋼鐵","lab":"A62","t":"礦井"},{"w":"tunnel","pos":"n.","def":"a long passage under the ground","cn":"隧道;坑道","s":"The train went into a long ________ under the mountain, and suddenly my phone lost its signal.","zh":"火車開進山底下一條長長的隧道,而我的手機突然沒有訊號了。","part":"A","sec":"Mining, Iron & Steel 採礦與鋼鐵","lab":"A63","t":"隧道"},{"w":"ore","pos":"n.","def":"rock from which metal can be taken","cn":"礦石","s":"The rocks in this area contain copper ________, so a mining company wants to start digging here.","zh":"這個地區的岩石含有銅礦石,所以一家礦業公司想在這裡開挖。","part":"A","sec":"Mining, Iron & Steel 採礦與鋼鐵","lab":"A64","t":"礦石"},{"w":"iron ore","pos":"n.","def":"rock that contains iron","cn":"鐵礦石","s":"Australia exports a lot of ______ ______ to Asia, and much of it is turned into steel for buildings.","zh":"澳洲出口大量鐵礦石到亞洲,而其中很多被製成建築用的鋼材。","part":"A","sec":"Mining, Iron & Steel 採礦與鋼鐵","lab":"A65","t":"鐵礦石"},{"w":"cast iron","pos":"n.","def":"hard iron that is shaped by pouring it into a mould","cn":"鑄鐵","s":"My mother cooks with a heavy ______ ______ pan, and she says it lasts much longer than modern ones.","zh":"我媽媽用一個沉重的鑄鐵鍋煮飯,而她說它比現代的鍋子耐用得多。","part":"A","sec":"Mining, Iron & Steel 採礦與鋼鐵","lab":"A66","t":"鑄鐵"},{"w":"wrought iron","pos":"n.","def":"iron that is heated and bent into shapes by hand","cn":"鍛鐵;熟鐵","s":"The old park has beautiful ______ ______ gates, and tourists often stop to take pictures of them.","zh":"那座老公園有漂亮的鍛鐵大門,而遊客經常停下來拍照。","part":"A","sec":"Mining, Iron & Steel 採礦與鋼鐵","lab":"A67","t":"鍛鐵"},{"w":"pig iron","pos":"n.","def":"rough iron that comes straight from a furnace","cn":"生鐵","s":"Workers poured the hot ______ ______ into sand moulds, and then it was sent away to be made into steel.","zh":"工人們把熾熱的生鐵倒進沙模中,然後它被送去製成鋼。","part":"A","sec":"Mining, Iron & Steel 採礦與鋼鐵","lab":"A68","t":"生鐵"},{"w":"blast furnace","pos":"n.","def":"a huge furnace where hot air helps melt iron from rock","cn":"高爐;鼓風爐","s":"The ______ ______ burned day and night, so the sky above the town glowed orange after dark.","zh":"那座高爐日夜燃燒,所以天黑後鎮上的天空都閃著橘色的光。","part":"A","sec":"Mining, Iron & Steel 採礦與鋼鐵","lab":"A69","t":"高爐"},{"w":"ironworks","pos":"n.","def":"a factory where iron is made","cn":"鐵工廠;煉鐵廠","s":"The town grew quickly around the ________, and its population doubled in only twenty years.","zh":"這個小鎮圍繞著煉鐵廠迅速發展,而它的人口在短短二十年間就翻倍了。","part":"A","sec":"Mining, Iron & Steel 採礦與鋼鐵","lab":"A70","t":"煉鐵廠"},{"w":"steelworks","pos":"n.","def":"a factory where steel is made","cn":"鋼鐵廠","s":"My uncle got a job at the ________ after school, and he worked there for over thirty years.","zh":"我舅舅畢業後在鋼鐵廠找到工作,而他在那裡工作了三十多年。","part":"A","sec":"Mining, Iron & Steel 採礦與鋼鐵","lab":"A71","t":"鋼鐵廠"},{"w":"foundry","pos":"n.","def":"a factory where metal is melted and shaped","cn":"鑄造廠","s":"The bells for the church were made at a local ________, and each one weighed more than a car.","zh":"教堂的鐘是在當地一家鑄造廠製作的,而每一個都比一輛車還重。","part":"A","sec":"Mining, Iron & Steel 採礦與鋼鐵","lab":"A72","t":"鑄造廠"},{"w":"molten","pos":"adj.","def":"melted by very great heat","cn":"熔化的","s":"The workers wore thick gloves while they poured the ________ metal, because one drop could burn through skin.","zh":"工人們倒熔化的金屬時戴著厚手套,因為一滴就能燙穿皮膚。","part":"A","sec":"Mining, Iron & Steel 採礦與鋼鐵","lab":"A73","t":"熔化的"},{"w":"mould","pos":"n.","def":"a hollow shape into which hot liquid is poured","cn":"模具;鑄模","s":"We poured melted chocolate into a heart-shaped ________, and then we put it in the fridge to set.","zh":"我們把融化的巧克力倒進心形的模具裡,然後把它放進冰箱定型。","part":"A","sec":"Mining, Iron & Steel 採礦與鋼鐵","lab":"A74","t":"模具"},{"w":"anvil","pos":"n.","def":"a heavy iron block on which hot metal is hammered","cn":"鐵砧","s":"The smith hammered the red-hot metal on the ________, and sparks flew across the dark room.","zh":"鐵匠在鐵砧上敲打燒紅的金屬,而火花在昏暗的房間裡四處飛濺。","part":"A","sec":"Mining, Iron & Steel 採礦與鋼鐵","lab":"A75","t":"鐵砧"},{"w":"blacksmith","pos":"n.","def":"a person who makes things from iron by heating and hammering","cn":"鐵匠","s":"Every village once had a ________ who made horseshoes, but few people learn this skill today.","zh":"以前每個村莊都有一位做馬蹄鐵的鐵匠,但現在很少人學這項技藝了。","part":"A","sec":"Mining, Iron & Steel 採礦與鋼鐵","lab":"A76","t":"鐵匠"},{"w":"steel","pos":"n.","def":"a strong metal made from iron and carbon","cn":"鋼","s":"Modern skyscrapers have frames made of ________, so they can be much taller than old stone buildings.","zh":"現代摩天大樓的骨架是用鋼做的,所以它們可以比古老的石造建築高得多。","part":"A","sec":"Mining, Iron & Steel 採礦與鋼鐵","lab":"A77","t":"鋼"},{"w":"Bessemer process","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a cheap way to make steel by blowing air through iron","cn":"貝塞麥煉鋼法","s":"The ______ ______ made steel cheap for the first time, so railways and bridges could use it everywhere.","zh":"貝塞麥煉鋼法首次讓鋼變得便宜,所以鐵路和橋梁各處都能使用它。","part":"A","sec":"Mining, Iron & Steel 採礦與鋼鐵","lab":"A78","t":"貝塞麥煉鋼法"},{"w":"impurity","pos":"n.","def":"an unwanted substance mixed into something","cn":"雜質","s":"Blowing air through the hot iron burned away each ________, and the metal became much stronger.","zh":"讓空氣吹過熾熱的鐵會燒掉每一種雜質,而金屬變得堅固許多。","part":"A","sec":"Mining, Iron & Steel 採礦與鋼鐵","lab":"A79","t":"雜質"},{"w":"coal seam","pos":"n.","def":"a layer of coal under the ground","cn":"煤層","s":"The miners found a thick ______ ______ deep underground, but reaching it safely was very difficult.","zh":"礦工們在地底深處發現一個厚厚的煤層,但要安全地挖到它非常困難。","part":"A","sec":"Mining, Iron & Steel 採礦與鋼鐵","lab":"A80","t":"煤層"},{"w":"pickaxe","pos":"n.","def":"a heavy tool with a pointed metal head for breaking rock","cn":"鶴嘴鋤;十字鎬","s":"Each miner carried a ________ and a lamp, and they broke the hard rock by hand for hours.","zh":"每位礦工都帶著一把十字鎬和一盞燈,而他們徒手敲碎堅硬的岩石好幾個小時。","part":"A","sec":"Mining, Iron & Steel 採礦與鋼鐵","lab":"A81","t":"十字鎬"},{"w":"explosion","pos":"n.","def":"a sudden violent burst with a loud noise","cn":"爆炸","s":"Gas in the mine caused a terrible ________, and the whole town gathered at the gate for news.","zh":"礦坑裡的瓦斯引發了一場可怕的爆炸,而全鎮的人都聚集在大門口等消息。","part":"A","sec":"Mining, Iron & Steel 採礦與鋼鐵","lab":"A82","t":"爆炸"},{"w":"safety lamp","pos":"n.","def":"a special lamp that will not light gas in a mine","cn":"安全燈","s":"The new ______ ______ protected miners from deadly gas explosions, so far fewer men died underground after 1816.","zh":"新的安全燈保護礦工免於致命的瓦斯爆炸,所以1816年後在地下喪生的人少了很多。","part":"A","sec":"Mining, Iron & Steel 採礦與鋼鐵","lab":"A83","t":"安全燈"},{"w":"metallurgy","pos":"n.","def":"the science of metals and how to use them","cn":"冶金學","s":"My cousin studies ________ at university, and she hopes to design lighter metals for planes one day.","zh":"我表姊在大學唸冶金學,而她希望有一天能為飛機設計更輕的金屬。","part":"A","sec":"Mining, Iron & Steel 採礦與鋼鐵","lab":"A84","t":"冶金學"},{"w":"rivet","pos":"n.","def":"a short metal pin used to join metal sheets together","cn":"鉚釘","s":"The Eiffel Tower is held together by millions of ________, and workers put each one in by hand.","zh":"艾菲爾鐵塔是由數百萬顆鉚釘固定起來的,而工人們是一顆一顆用手裝上去的。","part":"A","sec":"Mining, Iron & Steel 採礦與鋼鐵","lab":"A85","t":"鉚釘"},{"w":"girder","pos":"n.","def":"a long strong metal beam that supports a building or bridge","cn":"大樑;鋼樑","s":"A crane lifted the huge steel ________ into place, while workers on the bridge guided it carefully.","zh":"起重機把巨大的鋼樑吊到定位,而橋上的工人小心地引導它。","part":"A","sec":"Mining, Iron & Steel 採礦與鋼鐵","lab":"A86","t":"鋼樑"},{"w":"railway","pos":"n.","def":"a system of tracks and trains for moving people and goods","cn":"鐵路","s":"The first public ________ opened in 1825, and soon people could travel between cities in hours, not days.","zh":"第一條公共鐵路在1825年開通,而很快人們就能在幾小時內而非幾天內往返城市。","part":"A","sec":"Transport: Railways, Canals & Cars 交通運輸:鐵路、運河與汽車","lab":"A87","t":"鐵路"},{"w":"locomotive","pos":"n.","def":"the engine that pulls a train","cn":"火車頭;機車","s":"The old steam ________ is kept in the museum, and visitors can climb into the driver's cab.","zh":"那輛老蒸汽火車頭保存在博物館裡,而參觀者可以爬進司機室。","part":"A","sec":"Transport: Railways, Canals & Cars 交通運輸:鐵路、運河與汽車","lab":"A88","t":"火車頭"},{"w":"steam train","pos":"n.","def":"a train pulled by an engine that uses steam","cn":"蒸汽火車","s":"We rode an old ______ ______ through the mountains, and the whistle echoed loudly across the valley.","zh":"我們搭乘一列老蒸汽火車穿越山區,而汽笛聲在山谷間響亮地迴盪。","part":"A","sec":"Transport: Railways, Canals & Cars 交通運輸:鐵路、運河與汽車","lab":"A89","t":"蒸汽火車"},{"w":"railway track","pos":"n.","def":"the metal rails that trains run on","cn":"鐵軌","s":"Never walk along the ______ ______, because trains move faster than you think and cannot stop quickly.","zh":"絕對不要沿著鐵軌走,因為火車行駛得比你想的快,而且無法很快停下來。","part":"A","sec":"Transport: Railways, Canals & Cars 交通運輸:鐵路、運河與汽車","lab":"A90","t":"鐵軌"},{"w":"rail","pos":"n.","def":"a train system; travel by train","cn":"鐵路(運輸)","s":"Travelling by ________ is better for the environment, so our school took the train to the science museum.","zh":"搭鐵路旅行對環境比較好,所以我們學校搭火車去科學博物館。","part":"A","sec":"Transport: Railways, Canals & Cars 交通運輸:鐵路、運河與汽車","lab":"A91","t":"鐵路"},{"w":"carriage","pos":"n.","def":"one of the separate parts of a train where people sit","cn":"(火車)車廂","s":"The front ________ was very crowded, so we walked to the back of the train and found empty seats.","zh":"前面的車廂非常擠,所以我們走到火車後段並找到了空位。","part":"A","sec":"Transport: Railways, Canals & Cars 交通運輸:鐵路、運河與汽車","lab":"A92","t":"車廂"},{"w":"wagon","pos":"n.","def":"a part of a train for carrying goods","cn":"貨車車廂","s":"Each ________ was filled with coal, and the long train moved slowly towards the port.","zh":"每一節貨車車廂都裝滿了煤,而那列長長的火車緩緩駛向港口。","part":"A","sec":"Transport: Railways, Canals & Cars 交通運輸:鐵路、運河與汽車","lab":"A93","t":"貨車車廂"},{"w":"station","pos":"n.","def":"a place where trains stop for passengers","cn":"車站","s":"We arrived at the ________ ten minutes early, but the train was delayed because of heavy snow.","zh":"我們提早十分鐘到達車站,但火車因為大雪而誤點了。","part":"A","sec":"Transport: Railways, Canals & Cars 交通運輸:鐵路、運河與汽車","lab":"A94","t":"車站"},{"w":"level crossing","pos":"n.","def":"a place where a road crosses a railway line","cn":"平交道","s":"The barriers came down at the ______ ______, so all the cars waited while the train rushed past.","zh":"平交道的柵欄放下來了,所以所有車子都在等待,而火車呼嘯而過。","part":"A","sec":"Transport: Railways, Canals & Cars 交通運輸:鐵路、運河與汽車","lab":"A95","t":"平交道"},{"w":"passenger","pos":"n.","def":"a person travelling in a vehicle who is not driving","cn":"乘客","s":"Every ________ must wear a seat belt on this bus, and the driver will not leave until everyone does.","zh":"這輛公車上每位乘客都必須繫安全帶,而司機在所有人繫好前不會開車。","part":"A","sec":"Transport: Railways, Canals & Cars 交通運輸:鐵路、運河與汽車","lab":"A96","t":"乘客"},{"w":"canal","pos":"n.","def":"a man-made river for boats","cn":"運河","s":"Before railways, factories sent goods along the ________, because boats could carry heavy loads cheaply.","zh":"在鐵路出現之前,工廠沿著運河運送貨物,因為船隻能便宜地載運重物。","part":"A","sec":"Transport: Railways, Canals & Cars 交通運輸:鐵路、運河與汽車","lab":"A97","t":"運河"},{"w":"lock","pos":"n.","def":"a section of a canal with gates to raise or lower boats","cn":"(運河)水閘;船閘","s":"Our boat entered the ________, and the water slowly rose until we could continue up the hill.","zh":"我們的船駛進船閘,而水慢慢上升,直到我們能繼續往山上航行。","part":"A","sec":"Transport: Railways, Canals & Cars 交通運輸:鐵路、運河與汽車","lab":"A98","t":"船閘"},{"w":"barge","pos":"n.","def":"a long flat boat for carrying goods on rivers or canals","cn":"駁船","s":"A horse pulled the heavy ________ along the canal, and a boy walked beside it with a stick.","zh":"一匹馬沿著運河拉著沉重的駁船,而一個男孩拿著棍子走在牠旁邊。","part":"A","sec":"Transport: Railways, Canals & Cars 交通運輸:鐵路、運河與汽車","lab":"A99","t":"駁船"},{"w":"towpath","pos":"n.","def":"a path beside a canal where horses once pulled boats","cn":"(運河邊的)縴道","s":"Today people cycle along the old ________, but in the past it was used by horses pulling boats.","zh":"現在人們沿著舊縴道騎腳踏車,但在過去它是給拉船的馬使用的。","part":"A","sec":"Transport: Railways, Canals & Cars 交通運輸:鐵路、運河與汽車","lab":"A100","t":"縴道"},{"w":"steamship","pos":"n.","def":"a large ship driven by steam power","cn":"蒸汽船;輪船","s":"The ________ crossed the Atlantic in two weeks, so letters and goods arrived much sooner than before.","zh":"那艘蒸汽船兩週就橫越大西洋,所以信件和貨物比以前早得多送達。","part":"A","sec":"Transport: Railways, Canals & Cars 交通運輸:鐵路、運河與汽車","lab":"A101","t":"蒸汽船"},{"w":"paddle steamer","pos":"n.","def":"a steamboat moved by large turning wheels on its sides","cn":"明輪汽船","s":"We took a trip on an old ______ ______, and the big wheels splashed loudly as we moved down the river.","zh":"我們搭乘一艘老明輪汽船遊覽,而當我們順河而下時,大輪子嘩啦嘩啦地拍打著水。","part":"A","sec":"Transport: Railways, Canals & Cars 交通運輸:鐵路、運河與汽車","lab":"A102","t":"明輪汽船"},{"w":"horse-drawn","pos":"adj.","def":"pulled by a horse","cn":"馬拉的","s":"________ carts were common in big cities, but they made the streets dirty, noisy and very slow.","zh":"馬拉的貨車在大城市很常見,但它們讓街道變得又髒、又吵、又非常緩慢。","part":"A","sec":"Transport: Railways, Canals & Cars 交通運輸:鐵路、運河與汽車","lab":"A103","t":"馬拉的"},{"w":"automobile","pos":"n.","def":"a car","cn":"汽車","s":"Karl Benz built the first practical ________ in 1885, and within fifty years cars had changed city life.","zh":"卡爾·賓士在1885年製造出第一輛實用的汽車,而在五十年內汽車就改變了城市生活。","part":"A","sec":"Transport: Railways, Canals & Cars 交通運輸:鐵路、運河與汽車","lab":"A104","t":"汽車"},{"w":"motor car","pos":"n.","def":"an old-fashioned word for a car","cn":"汽車(舊稱)","s":"My great-grandmother remembered the first ______ ______ in her village, and everyone ran outside to look at it.","zh":"我曾祖母記得她村裡的第一輛汽車,而大家都跑出去看它。","part":"A","sec":"Transport: Railways, Canals & Cars 交通運輸:鐵路、運河與汽車","lab":"A105","t":"汽車"},{"w":"steam car","pos":"n.","def":"a car that uses a steam engine","cn":"蒸汽汽車","s":"The ______ ______ was quiet and powerful, but it took too long to start on cold mornings.","zh":"蒸汽汽車安靜又有力,但在寒冷的早晨要花太久時間才能啟動。","part":"A","sec":"Transport: Railways, Canals & Cars 交通運輸:鐵路、運河與汽車","lab":"A106","t":"蒸汽汽車"},{"w":"bicycle","pos":"n.","def":"a vehicle with two wheels that you ride by pushing pedals","cn":"腳踏車","s":"The ________ gave working people cheap freedom, so they could visit the countryside on weekends.","zh":"腳踏車給了勞工們便宜的自由,讓他們週末可以去鄉間遊玩。","part":"A","sec":"Transport: Railways, Canals & Cars 交通運輸:鐵路、運河與汽車","lab":"A107","t":"腳踏車"},{"w":"tyre","pos":"n.","def":"a rubber ring filled with air around a wheel","cn":"輪胎","s":"I got a flat ________ on the way to school, so I had to push my bike for the last two kilometres.","zh":"我在上學途中輪胎爆了,所以最後兩公里我只好牽著腳踏車走。","part":"A","sec":"Transport: Railways, Canals & Cars 交通運輸:鐵路、運河與汽車","lab":"A108","t":"輪胎"},{"w":"chassis","pos":"n.","def":"the frame of a vehicle that holds the engine and body","cn":"底盤;車架","s":"The factory first builds the ________, and then workers add the engine, wheels and seats.","zh":"工廠先打造底盤,然後工人們加上引擎、輪子和座椅。","part":"A","sec":"Transport: Railways, Canals & Cars 交通運輸:鐵路、運河與汽車","lab":"A109","t":"底盤"},{"w":"steering wheel","pos":"n.","def":"the wheel a driver turns to control a car's direction","cn":"方向盤","s":"Early cars used a stick instead of a ______ ______, so turning corners was quite difficult.","zh":"早期汽車用一根桿子而不是方向盤,所以轉彎相當困難。","part":"A","sec":"Transport: Railways, Canals & Cars 交通運輸:鐵路、運河與汽車","lab":"A110","t":"方向盤"},{"w":"brake","pos":"n.","def":"a part that makes a vehicle slow down or stop","cn":"煞車","s":"The driver hit the ________ when a dog ran into the road, and luckily nobody was hurt.","zh":"一隻狗衝到馬路上時司機踩了煞車,而幸好沒有人受傷。","part":"A","sec":"Transport: Railways, Canals & Cars 交通運輸:鐵路、運河與汽車","lab":"A111","t":"煞車"},{"w":"engine driver","pos":"n.","def":"a person who drives a train","cn":"火車司機","s":"The ______ ______ blew the whistle twice, and the children on the platform waved goodbye.","zh":"火車司機鳴了兩次汽笛,而月台上的孩子們揮手道別。","part":"A","sec":"Transport: Railways, Canals & Cars 交通運輸:鐵路、運河與汽車","lab":"A112","t":"火車司機"},{"w":"conductor","pos":"n.","def":"a person who checks tickets on a train or bus","cn":"車掌;列車長","s":"The ________ checked our tickets carefully, but he let my little brother travel for free.","zh":"車掌仔細檢查我們的車票,但他讓我弟弟免費搭乘。","part":"A","sec":"Transport: Railways, Canals & Cars 交通運輸:鐵路、運河與汽車","lab":"A113","t":"車掌"},{"w":"viaduct","pos":"n.","def":"a long high bridge that carries a road or railway across a valley","cn":"高架橋","s":"The train crossed a tall stone ________, and we could see the river far below our window.","zh":"火車越過一座高高的石造高架橋,而我們從窗戶可以看到遠在下方的河流。","part":"A","sec":"Transport: Railways, Canals & Cars 交通運輸:鐵路、運河與汽車","lab":"A114","t":"高架橋"},{"w":"commuter","pos":"n.","def":"a person who travels some distance to work every day","cn":"通勤者","s":"My father is a daily ________ who takes the 7:15 train into the city, and he reads the news on his phone during the trip.","zh":"我爸爸是每天搭7點15分火車進城的通勤者,而他在車程中用手機看新聞。","part":"A","sec":"Transport: Railways, Canals & Cars 交通運輸:鐵路、運河與汽車","lab":"A115","t":"通勤者"},{"w":"inventor","pos":"n.","def":"a person who creates something new for the first time","cn":"發明家","s":"Thomas Edison was a famous ________, but he worked with a large team of skilled assistants.","zh":"湯瑪斯·愛迪生是一位著名的發明家,但他和一大群熟練的助手一起工作。","part":"A","sec":"Inventors, Inventions & Science 發明家、發明與科學","lab":"A116","t":"發明家"},{"w":"invention","pos":"n.","def":"something new that someone has made or designed","cn":"發明;發明物","s":"The printing press was an important ________, because it let ideas spread quickly across Europe.","zh":"印刷機是一項重要的發明,因為它讓思想迅速在歐洲傳播。","part":"A","sec":"Inventors, Inventions & Science 發明家、發明與科學","lab":"A117","t":"發明"},{"w":"invent","pos":"v.","def":"to make or design something that did not exist before","cn":"發明","s":"Alexander Graham Bell ________ the telephone in 1876, and soon people could talk across long distances.","zh":"亞歷山大·格拉漢姆·貝爾在1876年發明了電話,而很快人們就能遠距離交談。","part":"A","sec":"Inventors, Inventions & Science 發明家、發明與科學","lab":"A118","t":"發明"},{"w":"ingenious","pos":"adj.","def":"very clever and original","cn":"巧妙的;有創意的","s":"My brother found an ________ way to water his plants while we were away, and none of them died.","zh":"我哥哥想到一個巧妙的方法在我們外出時幫植物澆水,而沒有一株枯死。","part":"A","sec":"Inventors, Inventions & Science 發明家、發明與科學","lab":"A119","t":"巧妙的"},{"w":"tinker","pos":"v.","def":"to try to repair or improve something by small changes","cn":"修補;擺弄","s":"He loves to ________ with old radios in the garage, and sometimes he makes them work again.","zh":"他喜歡在車庫裡擺弄舊收音機,而有時候他能讓它們重新運作。","part":"A","sec":"Inventors, Inventions & Science 發明家、發明與科學","lab":"A120","t":"擺弄"},{"w":"trial","pos":"n.","def":"a test to see if something works well","cn":"試驗;試用","s":"The new engine failed its first ________, but the engineers fixed the problem within a week.","zh":"新引擎第一次試驗失敗了,但工程師們在一週內就解決了問題。","part":"A","sec":"Inventors, Inventions & Science 發明家、發明與科學","lab":"A121","t":"試驗"},{"w":"experiment","pos":"n.","def":"a scientific test to find out something","cn":"實驗","s":"We did a simple ________ in class with magnets, and everyone was surprised by the results.","zh":"我們在課堂上用磁鐵做了一個簡單的實驗,而大家都對結果感到驚訝。","part":"A","sec":"Inventors, Inventions & Science 發明家、發明與科學","lab":"A122","t":"實驗"},{"w":"mechanic","pos":"n.","def":"a person who repairs engines and machines","cn":"技師;修車工","s":"The ________ found the problem quickly, but he needed two days to order the right part.","zh":"技師很快就找到了問題,但他需要兩天來訂購正確的零件。","part":"A","sec":"Inventors, Inventions & Science 發明家、發明與科學","lab":"A123","t":"技師"},{"w":"engineering","pos":"n.","def":"the work of designing and building machines, roads and bridges","cn":"工程(學)","s":"She wants to study ________ at university, because she loves solving problems and building things.","zh":"她想在大學唸工程,因為她熱愛解決問題和動手做東西。","part":"A","sec":"Inventors, Inventions & Science 發明家、發明與科學","lab":"A124","t":"工程"},{"w":"physicist","pos":"n.","def":"a scientist who studies energy, force and matter","cn":"物理學家","s":"The ________ explained how electricity works, and the audience finally understood why lights switch on.","zh":"那位物理學家解釋了電是怎麼運作的,而觀眾終於明白燈為什麼會亮。","part":"A","sec":"Inventors, Inventions & Science 發明家、發明與科學","lab":"A125","t":"物理學家"},{"w":"chemist","pos":"n.","def":"a scientist who studies substances and how they change","cn":"化學家","s":"A young ________ discovered the first artificial dye by accident, and it made him very rich.","zh":"一位年輕的化學家意外發現了第一種人工染料,而它讓他變得非常富有。","part":"A","sec":"Inventors, Inventions & Science 發明家、發明與科學","lab":"A126","t":"化學家"},{"w":"discovery","pos":"n.","def":"the act of finding something that was not known before","cn":"發現","s":"The ________ of electricity changed everyday life, but it took many years to reach ordinary homes.","zh":"電的發現改變了日常生活,但它花了很多年才進入一般家庭。","part":"A","sec":"Inventors, Inventions & Science 發明家、發明與科學","lab":"A127","t":"發現"},{"w":"innovator","pos":"n.","def":"a person who introduces new ideas or methods","cn":"創新者","s":"Steve Jobs is often called an ________, although many people helped him create his famous products.","zh":"史蒂夫·賈伯斯常被稱為創新者,雖然有很多人幫他打造出那些知名產品。","part":"A","sec":"Inventors, Inventions & Science 發明家、發明與科學","lab":"A128","t":"創新者"},{"w":"improvement","pos":"n.","def":"a change that makes something better","cn":"改進;改善","s":"Watt's ________ to the steam engine saved coal, so factory owners were eager to buy his machines.","zh":"瓦特對蒸汽機的改進節省了煤,所以工廠老闆們都急著買他的機器。","part":"A","sec":"Inventors, Inventions & Science 發明家、發明與科學","lab":"A129","t":"改進"},{"w":"contraption","pos":"n.","def":"a strange or complicated machine or device","cn":"奇怪的裝置","s":"My little sister built a funny ________ from boxes and string, and it actually feeds the cat.","zh":"我妹妹用箱子和繩子做了一個好笑的奇怪裝置,而它居然真的能餵貓。","part":"A","sec":"Inventors, Inventions & Science 發明家、發明與科學","lab":"A130","t":"奇怪裝置"},{"w":"gizmo","pos":"n.","def":"a small clever device (informal)","cn":"小玩意兒;小裝置","s":"Dad bought a new kitchen ________ that peels apples, but we still prefer using a knife.","zh":"爸爸買了一個能削蘋果皮的新廚房小玩意兒,但我們還是比較喜歡用刀子。","part":"A","sec":"Inventors, Inventions & Science 發明家、發明與科學","lab":"A131","t":"小玩意兒"},{"w":"imitation","pos":"n.","def":"a copy of something","cn":"仿製品;模仿","s":"The shop sold a cheap ________ of the famous watch, but it stopped working after a month.","zh":"那家店賣那款名錶的便宜仿製品,但它一個月後就壞了。","part":"A","sec":"Inventors, Inventions & Science 發明家、發明與科學","lab":"A132","t":"仿製品"},{"w":"royalty","pos":"n.","def":"money paid to an inventor or writer each time their work is used","cn":"權利金;版稅","s":"The inventor received a ________ for every machine sold, so he earned money for many years.","zh":"發明家每賣出一台機器就收到一筆權利金,所以他好多年都持續有收入。","part":"A","sec":"Inventors, Inventions & Science 發明家、發明與科學","lab":"A133","t":"權利金"},{"w":"trademark","pos":"n.","def":"a name or sign that belongs to one company","cn":"商標","s":"The company protected its ________ carefully, because the name was famous all over the world.","zh":"那家公司小心保護它的商標,因為那個名稱聞名全世界。","part":"A","sec":"Inventors, Inventions & Science 發明家、發明與科學","lab":"A134","t":"商標"},{"w":"sponsor","pos":"n.","def":"a person or company that gives money to support something","cn":"贊助者;贊助商","s":"The young inventor found a rich ________, so he could finally build a full-size model of his machine.","zh":"那位年輕發明家找到一位富有的贊助者,所以他終於能打造機器的實物大小模型。","part":"A","sec":"Inventors, Inventions & Science 發明家、發明與科學","lab":"A135","t":"贊助者"},{"w":"backer","pos":"n.","def":"someone who supports a project with money","cn":"資助者;支持者","s":"The project failed when its main ________ pulled out, and the workshop had to close.","zh":"當主要資助者撤資時那個計畫就失敗了,而工作坊也不得不關門。","part":"A","sec":"Inventors, Inventions & Science 發明家、發明與科學","lab":"A136","t":"資助者"},{"w":"exhibition","pos":"n.","def":"a public show of objects or works","cn":"展覽","s":"The Great ________ of 1851 showed amazing new machines, and six million people came to see them.","zh":"1851年的萬國博覽會展出了驚人的新機器,而有六百萬人前來參觀。","part":"A","sec":"Inventors, Inventions & Science 發明家、發明與科學","lab":"A137","t":"博覽會"},{"w":"demonstration","pos":"n.","def":"showing how something works","cn":"示範;展示","s":"The inventor gave a ________ of his new telephone, and the crowd cheered when they heard his voice.","zh":"發明家為他的新電話做了一場示範,而當群眾聽到他的聲音時都歡呼起來。","part":"A","sec":"Inventors, Inventions & Science 發明家、發明與科學","lab":"A138","t":"示範"},{"w":"world's fair","pos":"n.","def":"a large international exhibition of new products and ideas","cn":"世界博覽會","s":"The Eiffel Tower was built for a ______ ______ in 1889, but it later became a symbol of Paris.","zh":"艾菲爾鐵塔是為1889年的世界博覽會而建造的,但後來它成為了巴黎的象徵。","part":"A","sec":"Inventors, Inventions & Science 發明家、發明與科學","lab":"A139","t":"世界博覽會"},{"w":"inventive","pos":"adj.","def":"good at thinking of new ideas","cn":"有創造力的","s":"Our science teacher is very ________, and she often turns rubbish into tools for our experiments.","zh":"我們的自然老師非常有創造力,而她常把垃圾變成我們做實驗的工具。","part":"A","sec":"Inventors, Inventions & Science 發明家、發明與科學","lab":"A140","t":"有創造力"},{"w":"sketch","pos":"n.","def":"a quick simple drawing","cn":"草圖;素描","s":"Leonardo da Vinci made a ________ of a flying machine, but nobody could build it at that time.","zh":"李奧納多·達文西畫了一張飛行機器的草圖,但當時沒有人能把它造出來。","part":"A","sec":"Inventors, Inventions & Science 發明家、發明與科學","lab":"A141","t":"草圖"},{"w":"magnet","pos":"n.","def":"a piece of metal that pulls iron towards it","cn":"磁鐵","s":"I keep my shopping list on the fridge with a ________, so I never forget it when I go out.","zh":"我用磁鐵把購物清單貼在冰箱上,所以我出門時從不會忘記。","part":"A","sec":"Inventors, Inventions & Science 發明家、發明與科學","lab":"A142","t":"磁鐵"},{"w":"magnetism","pos":"n.","def":"the force that magnets produce","cn":"磁性;磁力","s":"Scientists studied ________ and electricity together in the 1820s, and their work led to the first electric motors.","zh":"科學家們在1820年代一起研究磁力和電,而他們的成果催生了第一批電動馬達。","part":"A","sec":"Inventors, Inventions & Science 發明家、發明與科學","lab":"A143","t":"磁力"},{"w":"wire","pos":"n.","def":"a long thin piece of metal used to carry electricity","cn":"電線;金屬線","s":"The lamp stopped working because a ________ was loose, so my dad fixed it with a screwdriver.","zh":"這盞燈不亮了是因為一條電線鬆了,所以我爸用螺絲起子修好了它。","part":"A","sec":"Inventors, Inventions & Science 發明家、發明與科學","lab":"A144","t":"電線"},{"w":"industrialisation","pos":"n.","def":"the growth of factories and industry in a country","cn":"工業化","s":"________ brought many new jobs to the cities, but it also brought pollution and crowded housing.","zh":"工業化為城市帶來了許多新的工作機會,但也帶來了污染和擁擠的住屋。","part":"A","sec":"Social Change: Workers, Cities & Reform 社會變遷:勞工、城市與改革","lab":"A145","t":"工業化"},{"w":"working class","pos":"n.","def":"people who do physical or factory work for wages","cn":"勞工階級","s":"The ______ ______ worked long hours in the mills, while the owners lived in large houses outside town.","zh":"勞工階級在工廠裡長時間工作,而工廠老闆則住在鎮外的大房子裡。","part":"A","sec":"Social Change: Workers, Cities & Reform 社會變遷:勞工、城市與改革","lab":"A146","t":"勞工階級"},{"w":"middle class","pos":"n.","def":"people with average income, such as teachers and shopkeepers","cn":"中產階級","s":"The ______ ______ grew quickly in the 1800s, and these families could afford pianos and books.","zh":"中產階級在1800年代迅速成長,而這些家庭買得起鋼琴和書籍。","part":"A","sec":"Social Change: Workers, Cities & Reform 社會變遷:勞工、城市與改革","lab":"A147","t":"中產階級"},{"w":"factory worker","pos":"n.","def":"a person who works in a factory","cn":"工廠工人","s":"As a ______ ______, my grandmother sewed shirts all day, but she still found time to read at night.","zh":"身為工廠工人,我祖母整天縫襯衫,但她晚上仍會抽空閱讀。","part":"A","sec":"Social Change: Workers, Cities & Reform 社會變遷:勞工、城市與改革","lab":"A148","t":"工廠工人"},{"w":"child labour","pos":"n.","def":"the use of children as workers","cn":"童工","s":"______ ______ was common in early factories, because children were small and their wages were low.","zh":"童工在早期工廠很常見,因為孩子們個子小而且工資低。","part":"A","sec":"Social Change: Workers, Cities & Reform 社會變遷:勞工、城市與改革","lab":"A149","t":"童工"},{"w":"working conditions","pos":"n.","def":"the hours, safety and environment of a job","cn":"工作環境;勞動條件","s":"The workers went on strike because their ______ ______ were dangerous, and the owners refused to listen.","zh":"工人們罷工是因為他們的工作環境很危險,而老闆們拒絕傾聽。","part":"A","sec":"Social Change: Workers, Cities & Reform 社會變遷:勞工、城市與改革","lab":"A150","t":"工作環境"},{"w":"slum","pos":"n.","def":"a very poor, crowded and dirty area of a city","cn":"貧民窟","s":"Thousands of families lived in the ________ near the factories, and diseases spread quickly there.","zh":"數千個家庭住在工廠附近的貧民窟裡,而疾病在那裡迅速傳播。","part":"A","sec":"Social Change: Workers, Cities & Reform 社會變遷:勞工、城市與改革","lab":"A151","t":"貧民窟"},{"w":"tenement","pos":"n.","def":"a large old building divided into small flats for poor families","cn":"廉價公寓;出租公寓","s":"Eight people shared one room in the ________, and they used a single toilet with the whole building.","zh":"八個人擠在廉價公寓的一個房間裡,而他們和整棟樓的人共用一間廁所。","part":"A","sec":"Social Change: Workers, Cities & Reform 社會變遷:勞工、城市與改革","lab":"A152","t":"廉價公寓"},{"w":"overcrowded","pos":"adj.","def":"having too many people in a space","cn":"過度擁擠的","s":"The trains are ________ during rush hour, so I usually leave home early to get a seat.","zh":"尖峰時段火車過度擁擠,所以我通常提早出門好找到座位。","part":"A","sec":"Social Change: Workers, Cities & Reform 社會變遷:勞工、城市與改革","lab":"A153","t":"過度擁擠"},{"w":"sanitation","pos":"n.","def":"systems for clean water and removing waste","cn":"衛生設施;公共衛生","s":"Better ________ in the cities saved thousands of lives, because clean water stopped many deadly diseases from spreading.","zh":"城市裡更好的衛生設施拯救了數千條人命,因為乾淨的水阻止了許多致命疾病的傳播。","part":"A","sec":"Social Change: Workers, Cities & Reform 社會變遷:勞工、城市與改革","lab":"A154","t":"衛生設施"},{"w":"cholera","pos":"n.","def":"a serious disease caused by dirty water","cn":"霍亂","s":"John Snow traced a ________ outbreak to one water pump, and the city removed its handle to stop it.","zh":"約翰·斯諾把一場霍亂疫情追查到一座抽水機,而市政府拆掉它的把手來阻止疫情。","part":"A","sec":"Social Change: Workers, Cities & Reform 社會變遷:勞工、城市與改革","lab":"A155","t":"霍亂"},{"w":"trade union","pos":"n.","def":"an organisation of workers that protects their rights","cn":"工會","s":"The workers formed a ______ ______, so they could ask for better pay together instead of alone.","zh":"工人們組成了一個工會,這樣他們就能一起而非單獨爭取更好的薪水。","part":"A","sec":"Social Change: Workers, Cities & Reform 社會變遷:勞工、城市與改革","lab":"A156","t":"工會"},{"w":"strike","pos":"n.","def":"a time when workers stop working to protest","cn":"罷工","s":"The bus drivers went on ________ last week, so many students had to walk or cycle to school.","zh":"公車司機上週舉行罷工,所以許多學生只好走路或騎腳踏車上學。","part":"A","sec":"Social Change: Workers, Cities & Reform 社會變遷:勞工、城市與改革","lab":"A157","t":"罷工"},{"w":"reformer","pos":"n.","def":"a person who works to improve society","cn":"改革者","s":"The ________ visited the dirty factories herself, and her reports shocked many people in the government.","zh":"那位改革者親自走訪骯髒的工廠,而她的報告震驚了許多政府官員。","part":"A","sec":"Social Change: Workers, Cities & Reform 社會變遷:勞工、城市與改革","lab":"A158","t":"改革者"},{"w":"minimum wage","pos":"n.","def":"the lowest pay that the law allows","cn":"最低工資","s":"The government raised the ______ ______ this year, but some shop owners say they cannot afford it.","zh":"政府今年調高了最低工資,但一些店家老闆說他們負擔不起。","part":"A","sec":"Social Change: Workers, Cities & Reform 社會變遷:勞工、城市與改革","lab":"A159","t":"最低工資"},{"w":"landlord","pos":"n.","def":"a person who rents a house or room to others","cn":"房東","s":"Our ________ raised the rent again, so my family is looking for a cheaper flat near my school.","zh":"我們的房東又調漲房租了,所以我家正在我學校附近找比較便宜的公寓。","part":"A","sec":"Social Change: Workers, Cities & Reform 社會變遷:勞工、城市與改革","lab":"A160","t":"房東"},{"w":"rural","pos":"adj.","def":"connected with the countryside","cn":"鄉村的;農村的","s":"Many young people left ________ areas for the big cities, because factories offered steady work and pay.","zh":"許多年輕人離開鄉村地區前往大城市,因為工廠提供穩定的工作和薪水。","part":"A","sec":"Social Change: Workers, Cities & Reform 社會變遷:勞工、城市與改革","lab":"A161","t":"鄉村"},{"w":"population growth","pos":"n.","def":"an increase in the number of people","cn":"人口成長","s":"Fast ______ ______ made the cities crowded, and the government struggled to build enough homes.","zh":"快速的人口成長讓城市變得擁擠,而政府難以蓋足夠的房子。","part":"A","sec":"Social Change: Workers, Cities & Reform 社會變遷:勞工、城市與改革","lab":"A162","t":"人口成長"},{"w":"workhouse","pos":"n.","def":"a place where very poor people lived and worked in the past","cn":"濟貧院;救濟院","s":"In Oliver Twist, the boy grows up in a ________, and he is punished for asking for more food.","zh":"在《孤雛淚》中,那個男孩在濟貧院長大,而他因為要求多一點食物而受罰。","part":"A","sec":"Social Change: Workers, Cities & Reform 社會變遷:勞工、城市與改革","lab":"A163","t":"濟貧院"},{"w":"chimney sweep","pos":"n.","def":"a person who cleans chimneys","cn":"掃煙囪工人","s":"In the past, a small boy often worked as a ______ ______, because he could climb inside narrow chimneys.","zh":"過去,小男孩常常當掃煙囪工人,因為他能爬進狹窄的煙囪裡。","part":"A","sec":"Social Change: Workers, Cities & Reform 社會變遷:勞工、城市與改革","lab":"A164","t":"掃煙囪工人"},{"w":"apprentice","pos":"n.","def":"a young person learning a skill from an expert","cn":"學徒","s":"He worked as an ________ to a carpenter for four years, and now he runs his own furniture business.","zh":"他當了四年木匠的學徒,而現在他經營自己的家具事業。","part":"A","sec":"Social Change: Workers, Cities & Reform 社會變遷:勞工、城市與改革","lab":"A165","t":"學徒"},{"w":"sweatshop","pos":"n.","def":"a factory where people work long hours for very low pay","cn":"血汗工廠","s":"Some cheap clothes are made in a ________, so we should check where our clothes come from.","zh":"有些便宜的衣服是在血汗工廠裡製造的,所以我們應該查查衣服的來源。","part":"A","sec":"Social Change: Workers, Cities & Reform 社會變遷:勞工、城市與改革","lab":"A166","t":"血汗工廠"},{"w":"riot","pos":"n.","def":"a violent protest by a crowd of people","cn":"暴動","s":"Hungry workers started a ________ when bread prices rose, and soldiers were sent to the town.","zh":"當麵包價格上漲時,飢餓的工人們發起了暴動,而士兵被派往那個小鎮。","part":"A","sec":"Social Change: Workers, Cities & Reform 社會變遷:勞工、城市與改革","lab":"A167","t":"暴動"},{"w":"capitalist","pos":"n.","def":"a person who uses money to own businesses and make profit","cn":"資本家","s":"The ________ invested in new machines, and he made huge profits while his workers stayed poor.","zh":"那位資本家投資新機器,而他賺取了巨額利潤,他的工人卻仍然貧窮。","part":"A","sec":"Social Change: Workers, Cities & Reform 社會變遷:勞工、城市與改革","lab":"A168","t":"資本家"},{"w":"capitalism","pos":"n.","def":"an economic system based on private business and profit","cn":"資本主義","s":"Under ________, companies compete to sell products, so prices can fall but some people are left behind.","zh":"在資本主義之下,公司們競爭銷售產品,所以價格可能下降,但有些人被拋在後頭。","part":"A","sec":"Social Change: Workers, Cities & Reform 社會變遷:勞工、城市與改革","lab":"A169","t":"資本主義"},{"w":"consumer goods","pos":"n.","def":"products that people buy for their own use","cn":"消費品","s":"Factories made ______ ______ like soap and shoes cheaper, so ordinary families could buy more.","zh":"工廠讓肥皂和鞋子這類消費品變得更便宜,所以一般家庭能買得更多。","part":"A","sec":"Social Change: Workers, Cities & Reform 社會變遷:勞工、城市與改革","lab":"A170","t":"消費品"},{"w":"standard of living","pos":"n.phr.","def":"how comfortable and wealthy people's lives are","cn":"生活水準","s":"Their ______ ______ ______ improved slowly, but it took decades before workers could afford good housing.","zh":"他們的生活水準慢慢提升,但過了幾十年工人才負擔得起好的住屋。","part":"A","sec":"Social Change: Workers, Cities & Reform 社會變遷:勞工、城市與改革","lab":"A171","t":"生活水準"},{"w":"life expectancy","pos":"n.","def":"the average number of years a person is likely to live","cn":"平均壽命;預期壽命","s":"______ ______ in factory towns was very low, but clean water and better food slowly raised it.","zh":"工廠城鎮的平均壽命非常低,但乾淨的水和更好的食物慢慢地提高了它。","part":"A","sec":"Social Change: Workers, Cities & Reform 社會變遷:勞工、城市與改革","lab":"A172","t":"平均壽命"},{"w":"telegraph","pos":"n.","def":"an old system for sending messages along wires using signals","cn":"電報","s":"News of the battle came by ________, so people in London knew about it on the same day.","zh":"戰役的消息透過電報傳來,所以倫敦的人們在同一天就知道了。","part":"A","sec":"Communication & Everyday Inventions 通訊與日常發明","lab":"A173","t":"電報"},{"w":"Morse code","pos":"n.","def":"a code of short and long signals for letters","cn":"摩斯密碼","s":"The soldiers sent short messages in ______ ______, and only trained operators could understand them quickly.","zh":"士兵們用摩斯密碼傳送簡短訊息,而只有受過訓練的操作員能迅速看懂。","part":"A","sec":"Communication & Everyday Inventions 通訊與日常發明","lab":"A174","t":"摩斯密碼"},{"w":"telephone","pos":"n.","def":"a device for talking to someone far away","cn":"電話","s":"My grandparents had only one ________ in the hall, and the whole family shared it.","zh":"我祖父母家只有一支電話放在走廊,而全家人共用它。","part":"A","sec":"Communication & Everyday Inventions 通訊與日常發明","lab":"A175","t":"電話"},{"w":"phonograph","pos":"n.","def":"an early machine for recording and playing sound","cn":"留聲機(早期)","s":"Edison recorded his own voice on the ________, and people could hardly believe a machine could talk.","zh":"愛迪生用留聲機錄下自己的聲音,而人們幾乎不敢相信機器會說話。","part":"A","sec":"Communication & Everyday Inventions 通訊與日常發明","lab":"A176","t":"留聲機"},{"w":"gramophone","pos":"n.","def":"an old machine that plays music from flat discs","cn":"唱機;留聲機","s":"My grandfather still plays old records on his ________, and the music sounds warm and a little scratchy.","zh":"我祖父仍用他的唱機播放老唱片,而音樂聽起來溫暖又帶點沙沙聲。","part":"A","sec":"Communication & Everyday Inventions 通訊與日常發明","lab":"A177","t":"唱機"},{"w":"camera","pos":"n.","def":"a device for taking photographs","cn":"相機","s":"I left my ________ at home on our trip, but luckily my phone took clear pictures.","zh":"旅行時我把相機留在家裡了,但幸好我的手機拍得很清楚。","part":"A","sec":"Communication & Everyday Inventions 通訊與日常發明","lab":"A178","t":"相機"},{"w":"photograph","pos":"n.","def":"a picture made with a camera","cn":"照片","s":"We found an old ________ of our town from 1900, and the main street looked completely different.","zh":"我們找到一張1900年我們小鎮的老照片,而主要街道看起來完全不一樣。","part":"A","sec":"Communication & Everyday Inventions 通訊與日常發明","lab":"A179","t":"照片"},{"w":"light bulb","pos":"n.","def":"a glass object that gives light when electricity passes through","cn":"燈泡","s":"The ______ ______ in my room burned out, so I did my homework in the kitchen last night.","zh":"我房間的燈泡燒壞了,所以我昨晚在廚房寫功課。","part":"A","sec":"Communication & Everyday Inventions 通訊與日常發明","lab":"A180","t":"燈泡"},{"w":"filament","pos":"n.","def":"a very thin wire inside a light bulb that glows","cn":"燈絲","s":"Edison tested thousands of materials for the ________, and he finally found one that glowed for hours.","zh":"愛迪生為燈絲測試了上千種材料,而他終於找到一種能發光好幾個小時的。","part":"A","sec":"Communication & Everyday Inventions 通訊與日常發明","lab":"A181","t":"燈絲"},{"w":"printing press","pos":"n.","def":"a machine for printing books and newspapers","cn":"印刷機","s":"The ______ ______ made books cheaper, so more people learned to read and share ideas.","zh":"印刷機讓書變得更便宜,所以更多人學會閱讀和分享想法。","part":"A","sec":"Communication & Everyday Inventions 通訊與日常發明","lab":"A182","t":"印刷機"},{"w":"typewriter","pos":"n.","def":"a machine with keys for printing letters onto paper","cn":"打字機","s":"My mother learned to type on a ________, so she still presses the keys very hard on her laptop.","zh":"我媽媽是用打字機學打字的,所以她在筆電上還是很用力地按鍵。","part":"A","sec":"Communication & Everyday Inventions 通訊與日常發明","lab":"A183","t":"打字機"},{"w":"radio","pos":"n.","def":"a device that receives sound broadcasts","cn":"收音機;廣播","s":"We listen to the ________ in the car every morning, and my dad always checks the traffic news.","zh":"我們每天早上在車上聽廣播,而我爸總是會注意交通新聞。","part":"A","sec":"Communication & Everyday Inventions 通訊與日常發明","lab":"A184","t":"廣播"},{"w":"transmitter","pos":"n.","def":"equipment that sends out radio or TV signals","cn":"發射器;發報機","s":"The station built a tall ________ on the mountain, so people far away could hear the programmes.","zh":"電台在山上蓋了一座高高的發射器,讓遠方的人也能收聽節目。","part":"A","sec":"Communication & Everyday Inventions 通訊與日常發明","lab":"A185","t":"發射器"},{"w":"receiver","pos":"n.","def":"the part of a telephone you hold to your ear","cn":"聽筒;接收器","s":"She picked up the ________ and heard a strange voice, but the caller hung up before she could answer.","zh":"她拿起聽筒聽到一個陌生的聲音,但對方在她回答前就掛斷了。","part":"A","sec":"Communication & Everyday Inventions 通訊與日常發明","lab":"A186","t":"聽筒"},{"w":"signal","pos":"n.","def":"a sound, light or wave that carries information","cn":"訊號;信號","s":"The guard waved a green flag as a ________, and the train slowly pulled out of the station.","zh":"列車長揮動綠旗作為信號,而火車慢慢駛出車站。","part":"A","sec":"Communication & Everyday Inventions 通訊與日常發明","lab":"A187","t":"信號"},{"w":"refrigerator","pos":"n.","def":"a machine that keeps food cold","cn":"冰箱","s":"Before the ________ was invented, people kept food in cool cellars, but it still went bad quickly.","zh":"在冰箱發明之前,人們把食物放在陰涼的地窖裡,但它還是很快就壞了。","part":"A","sec":"Communication & Everyday Inventions 通訊與日常發明","lab":"A188","t":"冰箱"},{"w":"canned food","pos":"n.","def":"food kept in sealed metal containers","cn":"罐頭食品","s":"Sailors took ______ ______ on long voyages, because it stayed safe to eat for months.","zh":"水手們長途航行時會帶罐頭食品,因為它可以安全食用好幾個月。","part":"A","sec":"Communication & Everyday Inventions 通訊與日常發明","lab":"A189","t":"罐頭食品"},{"w":"tin can","pos":"n.","def":"a metal container for keeping food","cn":"鐵罐;罐頭","s":"We made a simple phone from two ______ ______ and a string, and it actually worked across the garden.","zh":"我們用兩個鐵罐和一條繩子做了一支簡單的電話,而它真的能隔著花園通話。","part":"A","sec":"Communication & Everyday Inventions 通訊與日常發明","lab":"A190","t":"鐵罐"},{"w":"tennis racket","pos":"n.","def":"a bat with strings used to hit a tennis ball","cn":"網球拍","s":"My new ______ ______ is much lighter than my old wooden one, so I can swing it faster.","zh":"我的新網球拍比舊的木頭球拍輕多了,所以我可以揮得更快。","part":"A","sec":"Communication & Everyday Inventions 通訊與日常發明","lab":"A191","t":"網球拍"},{"w":"graphite","pos":"n.","def":"a soft black form of carbon used in pencils and sports equipment","cn":"石墨","s":"Pencils contain ________, not lead, and it is also used to make strong but light rackets.","zh":"鉛筆含有的是石墨而不是鉛,而它也被用來做堅固又輕巧的球拍。","part":"A","sec":"Communication & Everyday Inventions 通訊與日常發明","lab":"A192","t":"石墨"},{"w":"carbon fibre","pos":"n.","def":"a very strong light material made from thin threads of carbon","cn":"碳纖維","s":"Racing bikes are made of ______ ______, so they are light but still very strong.","zh":"競賽用腳踏車是用碳纖維做的,所以它們很輕卻依然非常堅固。","part":"A","sec":"Communication & Everyday Inventions 通訊與日常發明","lab":"A193","t":"碳纖維"},{"w":"elevator","pos":"n.","def":"a machine that carries people up and down in a building","cn":"電梯","s":"The ________ made tall buildings possible, because nobody wanted to climb twenty floors every day.","zh":"電梯讓高樓成為可能,因為沒有人想每天爬二十層樓。","part":"A","sec":"Communication & Everyday Inventions 通訊與日常發明","lab":"A194","t":"電梯"},{"w":"escalator","pos":"n.","def":"moving stairs","cn":"手扶梯","s":"The ________ at the station was broken, so we carried our heavy suitcases up the stairs.","zh":"車站的手扶梯壞了,所以我們把沉重的行李箱扛上樓梯。","part":"A","sec":"Communication & Everyday Inventions 通訊與日常發明","lab":"A195","t":"手扶梯"},{"w":"stethoscope","pos":"n.","def":"a tool doctors use to listen to your heart and breathing","cn":"聽診器","s":"The doctor put the cold ________ on my chest, and she asked me to breathe in deeply.","zh":"醫生把冰涼的聽診器放在我胸口,而她要我深呼吸。","part":"A","sec":"Communication & Everyday Inventions 通訊與日常發明","lab":"A196","t":"聽診器"},{"w":"vaccine","pos":"n.","def":"a substance that protects people from a disease","cn":"疫苗","s":"Edward Jenner made the first ________ in 1796, and it protected millions of people from deadly smallpox.","zh":"愛德華·詹納在1796年製成了第一支疫苗,而它保護了數百萬人免於致命的天花。","part":"A","sec":"Communication & Everyday Inventions 通訊與日常發明","lab":"A197","t":"疫苗"},{"w":"anaesthetic","pos":"n.","def":"a drug that stops you feeling pain during an operation","cn":"麻醉劑","s":"Before ________ was used, operations were terribly painful, so surgeons had to work very fast.","zh":"在使用麻醉劑之前,手術極度痛苦,所以外科醫生必須動作非常快。","part":"A","sec":"Communication & Everyday Inventions 通訊與日常發明","lab":"A198","t":"麻醉劑"},{"w":"penicillin","pos":"n.","def":"a medicine that kills bacteria","cn":"盤尼西林;青黴素","s":"Alexander Fleming discovered ________ by accident, and it has saved millions of lives since then.","zh":"亞歷山大·弗萊明意外發現了盤尼西林,而它從那時起已拯救了數百萬條生命。","part":"A","sec":"Communication & Everyday Inventions 通訊與日常發明","lab":"A199","t":"盤尼西林"},{"w":"plumbing","pos":"n.","def":"the pipes that carry water in a building","cn":"水管系統","s":"Modern ________ brought clean water into homes, so people no longer had to carry buckets from the well.","zh":"現代的水管系統把乾淨的水引進家中,所以人們不再需要從井裡提水。","part":"A","sec":"Communication & Everyday Inventions 通訊與日常發明","lab":"A200","t":"水管系統"},{"w":"achieve","pos":"v.","def":"to succeed in doing something after effort","cn":"達成;實現","s":"Edison failed many times, but he finally ________ his goal of making a light bulb that lasted for hours.","zh":"愛迪生失敗了很多次,但他最終實現了做出能亮好幾個小時燈泡的目標。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B1","t":"實現"},{"w":"administration","pos":"n.","def":"the work of organising and running a business or government","cn":"行政;管理","s":"The factory needed more office staff for ________, because it now had thousands of workers to pay.","zh":"工廠需要更多辦公室人員負責行政,因為它現在有數千名工人要發薪水。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B2","t":"行政"},{"w":"assistance","pos":"n.","def":"help or support","cn":"協助;幫助","s":"The old inventor needed ________ to finish his last machine, so his daughter helped him every evening.","zh":"年老的發明家需要協助來完成他的最後一台機器,所以他女兒每天晚上都幫他。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B3","t":"協助"},{"w":"category","pos":"n.","def":"a group of things that share the same features","cn":"類別;種類","s":"The museum puts each invention into a ________, such as transport or communication, so visitors can find them easily.","zh":"博物館把每項發明歸入一個類別,例如交通或通訊,讓參觀者容易找到。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B4","t":"類別"},{"w":"community","pos":"n.","def":"the people who live in one area","cn":"社區;群體","s":"When the mine closed, the whole ________ suffered, and many shops on the main street shut down.","zh":"當礦坑關閉時,整個社區都受到影響,而大街上許多商店都關門了。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B5","t":"社區"},{"w":"cultural","pos":"adj.","def":"connected with the art, ideas and customs of a society","cn":"文化的","s":"Railways brought big ________ changes, because people from different regions began to meet and share ideas.","zh":"鐵路帶來了巨大的文化變遷,因為來自不同地區的人們開始相遇並交流想法。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B6","t":"文化"},{"w":"institute","pos":"n.","def":"an organisation for research or education","cn":"研究所;學會","s":"She joined a research ________ after university, and now she studies how batteries can store more energy.","zh":"她大學畢業後加入了一個研究機構,而現在她研究電池如何儲存更多能量。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B7","t":"機構"},{"w":"journal","pos":"n.","def":"a serious magazine about a subject, often science","cn":"期刊","s":"The scientist published his results in a famous ________, and other researchers soon tested his ideas.","zh":"那位科學家把研究結果發表在一份著名的期刊上,而其他研究者很快就測試了他的想法。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B8","t":"期刊"},{"w":"select","pos":"v.","def":"to choose carefully from a group","cn":"挑選;選擇","s":"The judges will ________ the three best student inventions, and the winners will travel to the national fair.","zh":"評審將挑選出三件最佳學生發明,而得獎者將前往參加全國展覽會。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B9","t":"挑選"},{"w":"comment","pos":"n.","def":"something you say or write to give an opinion","cn":"評論;意見","s":"My teacher wrote a helpful ________ on my report, so I added more facts about the steam engine.","zh":"老師在我的報告上寫了一則有幫助的評語,所以我加入了更多關於蒸汽機的事實。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B10","t":"評語"},{"w":"philosophy","pos":"n.","def":"a set of beliefs about how to live or work","cn":"理念;哲學","s":"The company's ________ is to make simple products, and that is why its phones have so few buttons.","zh":"這家公司的理念是製造簡單的產品,而這就是為什麼它的手機按鍵這麼少。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B11","t":"理念"},{"w":"technology","pos":"n.","def":"scientific knowledge used in practical ways","cn":"科技;技術","s":"New ________ changes how we work, but older people sometimes find it hard to keep up.","zh":"新科技改變了我們工作的方式,但年長者有時覺得很難跟上。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B12","t":"科技"},{"w":"access","pos":"n.","def":"the chance or right to use something","cn":"使用權;取得機會","s":"Poor families had no ________ to clean water, so they often became sick from dirty wells.","zh":"貧窮家庭無法取得乾淨的水,所以他們常因骯髒的井水而生病。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B13","t":"取得"},{"w":"civil","pos":"adj.","def":"connected with ordinary citizens or the government, not the army","cn":"公民的;民用的;土木(工程)的","s":"The bridge was built by ________ engineers, and it still carries heavy traffic after a hundred years.","zh":"那座橋是由土木工程師建造的,而它在一百年後仍承載著繁忙的交通。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B14","t":"土木"},{"w":"communicate","pos":"v.","def":"to share information with others","cn":"溝通;傳達","s":"The telegraph helped people ________ across countries, so business decisions could be made much faster.","zh":"電報幫助人們跨國溝通,所以商業決策能做得快很多。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B15","t":"溝通"},{"w":"groundwork","pos":"n.","def":"early work that makes later progress possible","cn":"基礎;準備工作","s":"Early scientists laid the ________ for modern electricity, so later inventors could build on their ideas.","zh":"早期的科學家為現代電力打下了基礎,所以後來的發明家能在他們的想法上繼續發展。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B16","t":"基礎"},{"w":"summary","pos":"n.","def":"a short statement of the main points","cn":"摘要;總結","s":"Please write a ________ of the chapter in five sentences, and include the most important inventions.","zh":"請用五個句子寫出這一章的摘要,並且包含最重要的發明。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B17","t":"摘要"},{"w":"academy","pos":"n.","def":"a school or society for special training or study","cn":"學院;研究院","s":"The Royal ________ of Sciences gave him a medal, and his invention became famous across Europe.","zh":"皇家科學院頒給他一枚獎章,而他的發明因此聞名全歐洲。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B18","t":"院"},{"w":"energy","pos":"n.","def":"power from sources like coal, oil or electricity","cn":"能源","s":"Coal was the main source of ________ in the 1800s, but today we are trying to use cleaner sources.","zh":"煤是1800年代主要的能源來源,但今天我們正嘗試使用更乾淨的來源。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B19","t":"能源"},{"w":"liberal","pos":"adj.","def":"supporting freedom and gradual social change","cn":"自由主義的;開明的","s":"The ________ politicians wanted to improve working conditions, but the factory owners fought against them.","zh":"開明派政治人物想改善勞動條件,但工廠老闆們反對他們。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B20","t":"開明派"},{"w":"estate","pos":"n.","def":"a large area of land with a big house, owned by one person","cn":"莊園;地產","s":"The rich family owned a huge country ________, and they rarely visited the dirty factory towns.","zh":"那個富有的家族擁有一座巨大的鄉間莊園,而他們很少造訪髒亂的工廠城鎮。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B21","t":"莊園"},{"w":"expert","pos":"n.","def":"a person with special knowledge or skill","cn":"專家","s":"We asked an ________ to look at the old clock, and she said it was made in London in 1820.","zh":"我們請一位專家看看這座老鐘,而她說它是1820年在倫敦製造的。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B22","t":"專家"},{"w":"ministry","pos":"n.","def":"a government department","cn":"(政府)部會","s":"The ________ of Transport plans to build a new railway line, but local farmers are against it.","zh":"交通部計劃興建一條新鐵路線,但當地農民反對。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B23","t":"部"},{"w":"aid","pos":"n.","def":"help, especially money or food given to people in need","cn":"援助;救助","s":"The charity sent food ________ to the miners' families, because the men had been on strike for weeks.","zh":"慈善團體送了食物援助給礦工家庭,因為那些男人已經罷工好幾週了。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B24","t":"援助"},{"w":"chemical","pos":"n.","def":"a substance made by or used in chemistry","cn":"化學物質;化學品","s":"The factory poured a dangerous ________ into the river, and many fish died within a few days.","zh":"工廠把一種危險的化學物質倒進河裡,而許多魚在幾天內就死了。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B25","t":"化學物質"},{"w":"classic","pos":"adj.","def":"very good and a typical example of its kind","cn":"經典的","s":"The Model T is a ________ car, and collectors still pay a lot of money for one in good condition.","zh":"T型車是一款經典汽車,而收藏家仍願意花大錢買一輛車況良好的。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B26","t":"經典"},{"w":"definite","pos":"adj.","def":"clear and certain","cn":"明確的;肯定的","s":"We do not have a ________ date for the museum trip yet, but it will probably be in December.","zh":"我們還沒有參觀博物館的確定日期,但它可能會在十二月。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B27","t":"確定"},{"w":"publication","pos":"n.","def":"the act of printing a book or article for the public","cn":"出版;刊物","s":"After the ________ of his book, Darwin became famous, but many people strongly disagreed with him.","zh":"他的書出版之後,達爾文變得很有名,但許多人強烈反對他。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B28","t":"出版"},{"w":"found","pos":"v.","def":"to start an organisation or company","cn":"創立;建立","s":"Henry Ford ________ his car company in 1903, and it grew into one of the largest in the world.","zh":"亨利·福特在1903年創立了他的汽車公司,而它成長為世界上最大的公司之一。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B29","t":"創立"},{"w":"revolution","pos":"n.","def":"a huge change in the way people live or work","cn":"革命;重大變革","s":"The smartphone started a ________ in communication, and now most people carry the internet in their pocket.","zh":"智慧型手機掀起了一場通訊革命,而現在大多數人口袋裡都帶著網路。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B30","t":"革命"},{"w":"subordinate","pos":"n.","def":"a person with a lower position at work","cn":"下屬;部屬","s":"The manager blamed his ________ for the mistake, but everyone knew he had made the decision himself.","zh":"經理把錯誤怪到他的下屬身上,但大家都知道是他自己做的決定。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B31","t":"下屬"},{"w":"consist","pos":"v.","def":"to be made of (with \"of\")","cn":"由……組成","s":"A steam engine mainly ________ of a boiler, a cylinder and a piston, but there are many smaller parts too.","zh":"蒸汽機主要由鍋爐、汽缸和活塞組成,但也有許多較小的零件。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B32","t":"由 組成"},{"w":"economy","pos":"n.","def":"the system of money, trade and industry in a country","cn":"經濟","s":"Britain's ________ grew rapidly in the 1800s, and it became the richest country in the world.","zh":"英國的經濟在1800年代快速成長,而它成為了世界上最富有的國家。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B33","t":"經濟"},{"w":"legal","pos":"adj.","def":"allowed by law","cn":"合法的","s":"It was ________ to employ young children in the early mills, but new laws later stopped this practice.","zh":"在早期工廠雇用幼童是合法的,但後來新的法律禁止了這種做法。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B34","t":"合法的"},{"w":"role","pos":"n.","def":"the job or purpose someone or something has","cn":"角色;作用","s":"Women played an important ________ in the textile mills, although they were paid much less than men.","zh":"女性在紡織廠中扮演重要的角色,雖然她們的薪水比男性少很多。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B35","t":"角色"},{"w":"similar","pos":"adj.","def":"almost the same","cn":"相似的","s":"My design is ________ to my friend's, but mine uses less material and is easier to build.","zh":"我的設計和朋友的很相似,但我的用料較少而且比較容易製作。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B36","t":"相似"},{"w":"period","pos":"n.","def":"a length of time in history","cn":"時期","s":"The Victorian ________ saw many great inventions, and the population of Britain doubled at the same time.","zh":"維多利亞時期出現許多偉大的發明,而英國人口同時也增加了一倍。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B37","t":"時期"},{"w":"positive","pos":"adj.","def":"good or helpful","cn":"正面的;積極的","s":"The railway had a ________ effect on farmers, because they could now sell fresh food in distant cities.","zh":"鐵路對農民產生了正面的影響,因為他們現在能把新鮮食物賣到遙遠的城市。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B38","t":"正面的"},{"w":"emergence","pos":"n.","def":"the process of starting to exist or become known","cn":"出現;興起","s":"The ________ of factories changed family life, since parents now worked away from home all day.","zh":"工廠的興起改變了家庭生活,因為父母現在整天都離家工作。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B39","t":"興起"},{"w":"adoption","pos":"n.","def":"the act of starting to use something new","cn":"採用","s":"The ________ of electric lights made streets safer at night, so more people went out after dark.","zh":"電燈的採用讓夜晚的街道更安全,所以更多人在天黑後外出。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B40","t":"採用"},{"w":"commercialise","pos":"v.","def":"to make money from a product or idea by selling it","cn":"使商業化","s":"Many scientists made discoveries, but they did not know how to ________ them, so others got rich instead.","zh":"許多科學家有了發現,但他們不知道如何將其商業化,所以反而是別人致富了。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B41","t":"商業化"},{"w":"prosperity","pos":"n.","def":"the state of being rich and successful","cn":"繁榮;興旺","s":"The new port brought ________ to the town, and many families could finally afford better houses.","zh":"新港口為這個小鎮帶來了繁榮,而許多家庭終於買得起更好的房子。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B42","t":"繁榮"},{"w":"productive","pos":"adj.","def":"producing a lot","cn":"多產的;有生產力的","s":"Factories were much more ________ than home workshops, so the price of cloth dropped sharply.","zh":"工廠比家庭作坊更有生產力,所以布料價格大幅下降。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B43","t":"更有生產力"},{"w":"profitable","pos":"adj.","def":"making a lot of money","cn":"有利可圖的;賺錢的","s":"Selling cheap cotton shirts was very ________, so more and more mills opened in northern England.","zh":"販賣便宜的棉襯衫非常賺錢,所以越來越多工廠在英格蘭北部開設。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B44","t":"賺錢"},{"w":"mercantile","pos":"adj.","def":"connected with trade and merchants","cn":"商業的;貿易的","s":"Liverpool was a busy ________ city, and ships from all over the world unloaded goods in its docks.","zh":"利物浦是一座繁忙的商業城市,而來自世界各地的船隻在它的碼頭卸貨。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B45","t":"商業"},{"w":"capital","pos":"n.","def":"money used to start or grow a business","cn":"資本;資金","s":"He needed ________ to build his first factory, so he borrowed money from his wealthy uncle.","zh":"他需要資金來蓋他的第一間工廠,所以他向富有的叔叔借錢。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B46","t":"資金"},{"w":"commerce","pos":"n.","def":"buying and selling, especially on a large scale","cn":"商業;貿易","s":"Canals and railways helped ________ grow, because goods could reach customers faster and more cheaply.","zh":"運河和鐵路幫助商業成長,因為貨物能更快、更便宜地送達顧客手中。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B47","t":"商業"},{"w":"enterprise","pos":"n.","def":"a business or company","cn":"企業;事業","s":"Her small ________ began in her kitchen, but now it sells handmade soap all over the country.","zh":"她的小企業從她的廚房起步,而現在它在全國各地販售手工肥皂。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B48","t":"企業"},{"w":"industrious","pos":"adj.","def":"working hard","cn":"勤奮的","s":"The ________ young engineer worked late every night, and his boss soon gave him a bigger project.","zh":"那位勤奮的年輕工程師每晚都工作到很晚,而老闆很快就交給他更大的專案。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B49","t":"勤奮的"},{"w":"resourceful","pos":"adj.","def":"good at finding clever ways to solve problems","cn":"足智多謀的;機智的","s":"The ________ miners built a pump from old parts, so they could keep working after the flood.","zh":"足智多謀的礦工們用舊零件做了一台抽水機,所以他們在淹水後還能繼續工作。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B50","t":"足智多謀的"},{"w":"visionary","pos":"adj.","def":"having bold, original ideas about the future","cn":"有遠見的","s":"The ________ engineer imagined trains under the city, and fifty years later London opened its first underground line.","zh":"那位有遠見的工程師構想了城市底下的火車,而五十年後倫敦開通了第一條地下鐵路線。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B51","t":"有遠見的"},{"w":"transformative","pos":"adj.","def":"causing a great change","cn":"具變革性的","s":"Electricity was a ________ invention, because it changed how people worked, travelled and spent their evenings.","zh":"電是一項具變革性的發明,因為它改變了人們工作、旅行和度過夜晚的方式。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B52","t":"具變革性的"},{"w":"far-reaching","pos":"adj.","def":"having a big effect on many things","cn":"影響深遠的","s":"The new law had ________ effects, since it limited working hours in every factory in the country.","zh":"這項新法律產生了影響深遠的效果,因為它限制了全國每家工廠的工時。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B53","t":"影響深遠的"},{"w":"momentous","pos":"adj.","def":"very important, especially for the future","cn":"極重要的;重大的","s":"The first flight in 1903 was a ________ event, but only a few people saw it with their own eyes.","zh":"1903年的首次飛行是一個重大的事件,但只有少數人親眼目睹。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B54","t":"重大的"},{"w":"watershed","pos":"n.","def":"an event that marks a very important change","cn":"分水嶺;轉折點","s":"The year 1830 was a ________ for travel, because the first passenger railway between two cities opened.","zh":"1830年是旅行的分水嶺,因為第一條連接兩座城市的客運鐵路開通了。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B55","t":"分水嶺"},{"w":"origin","pos":"n.","def":"the place or point where something begins","cn":"起源","s":"The ________ of the word \"robot\" is a Czech play, but now people all over the world use it.","zh":"\"robot\"這個字的起源是一齣捷克劇作,但現在全世界的人都在使用它。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B56","t":"起源"},{"w":"fame","pos":"n.","def":"the state of being known by many people","cn":"名聲;名氣","s":"The inventor won ________ and money, but he said his greatest joy was solving difficult problems.","zh":"這位發明家贏得了名聲和財富,但他說他最大的喜悅是解決困難的問題。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B57","t":"名聲"},{"w":"reputation","pos":"n.","def":"the opinion people have about someone or something","cn":"聲譽;名聲","s":"The company has a good ________ for safety, so many parents trust its car seats for their babies.","zh":"這家公司在安全方面有良好的聲譽,所以許多父母信任它為嬰兒做的汽車座椅。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B58","t":"聲譽"},{"w":"perfect","pos":"v.","def":"to make something as good as possible","cn":"使完美;改進到完善","s":"The Wright brothers spent years trying to ________ their flying machine, and they tested it hundreds of times.","zh":"萊特兄弟花了好幾年試圖完善他們的飛行器,而他們測試了好幾百次。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B59","t":"完善"},{"w":"multiply","pos":"v.","def":"to increase greatly in number","cn":"成倍增加","s":"The number of factories began to ________ quickly, and soon the sky over the city was full of smoke.","zh":"工廠的數量開始迅速成倍增加,而很快城市上空就佈滿了煙霧。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B60","t":"成倍增加"},{"w":"diversify","pos":"v.","def":"to start making a wider range of products","cn":"使多樣化;多角化經營","s":"The company decided to ________ when cotton prices fell, so it also began making wool and silk.","zh":"當棉花價格下跌時,這家公司決定多角化經營,所以它也開始生產羊毛和絲綢。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B61","t":"多角化經營"},{"w":"operate","pos":"v.","def":"to make a machine work","cn":"操作;運轉","s":"Only trained workers could ________ the huge machines, but small children often cleaned underneath them while they ran.","zh":"只有受過訓練的工人能操作這些巨大的機器,但小孩子們常在機器運轉時鑽到下方打掃。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B62","t":"操作"},{"w":"spread","pos":"v.","def":"to move or reach a larger area","cn":"擴散;傳播","s":"News of the invention ________ quickly, and soon factories in America were copying the British machines.","zh":"這項發明的消息迅速傳開,而很快美國的工廠就仿造起英國的機器。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B63","t":"傳開"},{"w":"circulate","pos":"v.","def":"to move or pass around","cn":"流通;傳閱","s":"Newspapers began to ________ widely in the cities, so ordinary workers learned about politics and new ideas.","zh":"報紙開始在城市中廣泛流通,所以一般工人得以了解政治和新思想。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B64","t":"流通"},{"w":"supply","pos":"n.","def":"an amount of something that is available to use","cn":"供應;供給","s":"The city needed a steady ________ of coal, so trains brought it in from the mines every day.","zh":"城市需要穩定的煤供應,所以火車每天從礦場把煤運進來。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B65","t":"供應"},{"w":"demand","pos":"n.","def":"the need or wish of people to buy something","cn":"需求","s":"________ for cheap clothes grew quickly, so mill owners bought more machines and hired more workers.","zh":"對便宜衣服的需求迅速成長,所以工廠主購買了更多機器並雇用更多工人。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B66","t":"需求"},{"w":"consume","pos":"v.","def":"to use up fuel, energy or time","cn":"消耗;耗費","s":"Early steam engines ________ huge amounts of coal, but later designs were much more efficient.","zh":"早期的蒸汽機消耗大量的煤,但後來的設計效率高得多。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B67","t":"消耗"},{"w":"economise","pos":"v.","def":"to use less money or resources","cn":"節約;節省","s":"My family tries to ________ on electricity, so we turn off lights and unplug chargers every night.","zh":"我家努力節約用電,所以我們每晚關燈並拔掉充電器。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B68","t":"節約"},{"w":"inefficient","pos":"adj.","def":"wasting time, energy or money","cn":"效率低的","s":"The old machine was slow and ________, so the company replaced it with a modern one last year.","zh":"那台舊機器又慢又沒效率,所以公司去年把它換成了新型的。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B69","t":"沒效率"},{"w":"strenuous","pos":"adj.","def":"needing a lot of physical effort","cn":"費力的;艱苦的","s":"Mining was ________ work, and most miners suffered from back pain before they turned forty.","zh":"採礦是費力的工作,而大多數礦工在四十歲之前就飽受背痛之苦。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B70","t":"費力的"},{"w":"lethal","pos":"adj.","def":"able to kill","cn":"致命的","s":"Coal dust could be ________ in large amounts, but miners had no masks to protect their lungs.","zh":"大量的煤塵可能是致命的,但礦工們沒有口罩來保護他們的肺。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B71","t":"致命的"},{"w":"fatal","pos":"adj.","def":"causing death","cn":"致命的;導致死亡的","s":"There was a ________ accident at the factory last year, and it led to new safety rules for every machine.","zh":"去年工廠發生了一起致命意外,而它促使每台機器都有了新的安全規定。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B72","t":"致命"},{"w":"harmful","pos":"adj.","def":"causing damage or injury","cn":"有害的","s":"Smoke from the factories was ________ to people's health, but many families could not afford to move away.","zh":"工廠排出的煙對人們的健康有害,但許多家庭沒有能力搬走。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B73","t":"有害"},{"w":"squalid","pos":"adj.","def":"very dirty and unpleasant because of poverty","cn":"骯髒破敗的","s":"Many workers lived in ________ rooms without water, and their children often became sick in winter.","zh":"許多工人住在沒有水的骯髒破敗的房間裡,而他們的孩子在冬天常常生病。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B74","t":"骯髒破敗的"},{"w":"appalling","pos":"adj.","def":"shockingly bad","cn":"駭人的;極糟的","s":"The conditions in the mines were ________, so reporters wrote angry articles about them in the newspapers.","zh":"礦坑裡的環境極其惡劣,所以記者們在報紙上寫了憤怒的文章。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B75","t":"極其惡劣"},{"w":"deplorable","pos":"adj.","def":"very bad and deserving strong criticism","cn":"可悲的;應受譴責的","s":"Charles Dickens described the ________ life of poor children, and his novels made readers want change.","zh":"查爾斯·狄更斯描寫了窮苦孩子悲慘的生活,而他的小說讓讀者渴望改變。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B76","t":"悲慘的"},{"w":"grim","pos":"adj.","def":"unpleasant and depressing","cn":"嚴酷的;陰沉的","s":"Factory towns looked ________ and grey, but people still found ways to enjoy music and football.","zh":"工廠城鎮看起來陰沉又灰暗,但人們仍然找到方法享受音樂和足球。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B77","t":"陰沉"},{"w":"harsh","pos":"adj.","def":"cruel, severe or unkind","cn":"嚴苛的;殘酷的","s":"The rules in the mill were very ________, and workers lost a day's pay if they arrived five minutes late.","zh":"工廠裡的規定非常嚴苛,而工人遲到五分鐘就會被扣一天的工資。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B78","t":"嚴苛"},{"w":"destitute","pos":"adj.","def":"having no money, food or home","cn":"赤貧的;一無所有的","s":"When her husband died in the mine, the widow was left ________, so she had to beg on the streets.","zh":"當她丈夫死在礦坑中時,這位寡婦變得一貧如洗,所以她只好上街乞討。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B79","t":"一貧如洗"},{"w":"marginalised","pos":"adj.","def":"treated as unimportant and kept out of power","cn":"被邊緣化的","s":"________ groups had no vote in the 1800s, so their problems were often ignored by the government.","zh":"被邊緣化的群體在1800年代沒有投票權,所以他們的問題常被政府忽視。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B80","t":"被邊緣化的"},{"w":"unjust","pos":"adj.","def":"not fair or morally right","cn":"不公正的","s":"Workers felt the new rules were ________, because owners became richer while their pay went down.","zh":"工人們覺得新規定很不公正,因為老闆們越來越富有,而他們的薪水卻減少了。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B81","t":"不公正"},{"w":"injustice","pos":"n.","def":"a situation that is unfair","cn":"不公義;不公平","s":"The writer was angry about the ________ she saw in the mills, and she spent her life fighting for workers.","zh":"那位作家對她在工廠裡看到的不公義感到憤怒,而她一生都在為工人奮鬥。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B82","t":"不公義"},{"w":"grievance","pos":"n.","def":"a reason to complain about unfair treatment","cn":"不滿;怨言","s":"The workers listed every ________ in a letter, and they sent it to the factory owner and the newspaper.","zh":"工人們把每一項不滿列在一封信裡,並把它寄給工廠老闆和報社。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B83","t":"不滿"},{"w":"discontent","pos":"n.","def":"a feeling of being unhappy with a situation","cn":"不滿;不平","s":"________ grew among the weavers as machines took their jobs, and some of them broke the new looms.","zh":"隨著機器奪走工作,織工之間的不滿日益增加,而他們之中有些人砸毀了新織布機。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B84","t":"不滿"},{"w":"rebel","pos":"v.","def":"to fight against people in power","cn":"反抗;造反","s":"The workers decided to ________ against the long hours, so they refused to enter the factory one morning.","zh":"工人們決定反抗過長的工時,所以某天早上他們拒絕進入工廠。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B85","t":"反抗"},{"w":"rebellion","pos":"n.","def":"an organised fight against people in power","cn":"叛亂;反抗","s":"The army quickly stopped the ________, but the government later agreed to some of the workers' demands.","zh":"軍隊迅速平定了這場反抗,但政府後來同意了工人們的部分要求。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B86","t":"反抗"},{"w":"militant","pos":"adj.","def":"ready to use strong or violent action for a cause","cn":"好戰的;激進的","s":"Some ________ workers wanted to destroy the new machines, while others preferred a peaceful protest in the town square.","zh":"有些激進的工人想摧毀新機器,而其他人比較偏好在鎮上廣場和平抗議。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B87","t":"激進的"},{"w":"statute","pos":"n.","def":"a written law made by a government","cn":"法令;法規","s":"A new ________ banned children under nine from working in mills, and inspectors checked that owners obeyed.","zh":"一項新法令禁止九歲以下兒童在工廠工作,而督察員檢查老闆們是否遵守。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B88","t":"法令"},{"w":"outlaw","pos":"v.","def":"to make something illegal","cn":"宣布……為非法;禁止","s":"The government decided to ________ the use of young boys as chimney sweeps, but the practice continued for years.","zh":"政府決定立法禁止雇用小男孩掃煙囪,但這種做法仍持續了好幾年。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B89","t":"立法禁止"},{"w":"suffrage","pos":"n.","def":"the right to vote in elections","cn":"選舉權;投票權","s":"Workers fought for ________ for many years, and finally most men in Britain could vote by 1884.","zh":"工人們為爭取選舉權奮鬥了許多年,而到了1884年英國大多數男性終於可以投票。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B90","t":"選舉權"},{"w":"modernise","pos":"v.","def":"to make something more up to date","cn":"使現代化","s":"The town plans to ________ its old train station, so it will have lifts and new waiting rooms next year.","zh":"小鎮計劃將老舊的火車站現代化,所以明年它會有電梯和新的候車室。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B91","t":"現代化"},{"w":"populous","pos":"adj.","def":"having a large population","cn":"人口稠密的","s":"Manchester became a ________ city very quickly, but its streets and houses were not ready for so many people.","zh":"曼徹斯特很快就成為一座人口稠密的城市,但它的街道和房屋還沒準備好容納這麼多人。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B92","t":"人口稠密的"},{"w":"metropolitan","pos":"adj.","def":"connected with a large city","cn":"大都會的","s":"The ________ railway carried thousands of workers every day, so the city could spread far into the countryside.","zh":"大都會鐵路每天載運數千名工人,所以城市得以向鄉間遠遠擴展。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B93","t":"大都會"},{"w":"municipal","pos":"adj.","def":"connected with a town or city government","cn":"市政的;市立的","s":"The ________ council built public baths, and poor families could finally wash in clean hot water.","zh":"市議會興建了公共澡堂,而貧窮家庭終於能用乾淨的熱水洗澡。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B94","t":"市"},{"w":"civic","pos":"adj.","def":"connected with a town and its citizens","cn":"市民的;城市的","s":"The new town hall was a symbol of ________ pride, and local factory owners paid for most of it.","zh":"新市政廳是市民驕傲的象徵,而當地的工廠老闆們支付了大部分費用。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B95","t":"市民"},{"w":"epidemic","pos":"n.","def":"a disease that spreads to many people quickly","cn":"流行病;疫情","s":"A typhoid ________ hit the city in 1850, and doctors realised that dirty water was the cause.","zh":"1850年一場傷寒疫情侵襲這座城市,而醫生們意識到骯髒的水是元兇。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B96","t":"疫情"},{"w":"contagious","pos":"adj.","def":"spreading easily from one person to another","cn":"傳染性的","s":"The disease was highly ________, so sick children had to stay at home and could not go to school.","zh":"這種疾病具有高度傳染性,所以生病的孩子必須待在家而不能上學。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B97","t":"傳染性"},{"w":"mortality","pos":"n.","def":"the number of deaths in a group","cn":"死亡率","s":"Child ________ was very high in factory towns, but it fell after clean water was introduced.","zh":"工廠城鎮的兒童死亡率非常高,但在引進乾淨的水之後就下降了。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B98","t":"死亡率"},{"w":"hygiene","pos":"n.","def":"keeping yourself and places clean to stay healthy","cn":"衛生","s":"Good ________ prevents many diseases, so the nurse taught the children to wash their hands before meals.","zh":"良好的衛生習慣能預防許多疾病,所以護理師教孩子們飯前要洗手。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B99","t":"衛生"},{"w":"congestion","pos":"n.","def":"too much traffic in one place","cn":"擁擠;壅塞","s":"There was terrible ________ in the city centre this morning, and I was twenty minutes late for school.","zh":"今天早上市中心的交通嚴重壅塞,而我上學遲到了二十分鐘。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B100","t":"壅塞"},{"w":"noteworthy","pos":"adj.","def":"interesting or important enough to be noticed","cn":"值得注意的","s":"It is ________ that many great inventors had little formal education, but they never stopped learning on their own.","zh":"值得注意的是,許多偉大的發明家沒受過多少正規教育,但他們從未停止自學。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B101","t":"值得注意的"},{"w":"striking","pos":"adj.","def":"very noticeable or unusual","cn":"顯著的;引人注目的","s":"There is a ________ difference between old and new phones, and young people cannot imagine life with a dial phone.","zh":"舊手機和新手機之間有顯著的差異,而年輕人無法想像使用撥盤電話的生活。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B102","t":"顯著的"},{"w":"state-of-the-art","pos":"adj.","def":"using the newest and best technology","cn":"最先進的","s":"The hospital bought ________ equipment last year, so doctors can now find problems much earlier.","zh":"醫院去年購置了最先進的設備,所以醫生現在能更早發現問題。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B103","t":"最先進的"},{"w":"advanced","pos":"adj.","def":"modern and highly developed","cn":"先進的","s":"Britain had the most ________ machines in 1850, but Germany and America soon caught up.","zh":"英國在1850年擁有最先進的機器,但德國和美國很快就迎頭趕上。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B104","t":"先進的"},{"w":"imaginative","pos":"adj.","def":"having new and creative ideas","cn":"富想像力的","s":"The students came up with ________ designs for a bridge, and one group used only paper and glue.","zh":"學生們想出了富有想像力的橋梁設計,而其中一組只用了紙和膠水。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B105","t":"富有想像力的"},{"w":"theoretical","pos":"adj.","def":"based on ideas rather than practice","cn":"理論上的","s":"His plan was only ________ at first, but after ten years of work he built a machine that really worked.","zh":"他的計畫起初只是理論上的,但經過十年的努力他造出了一台真正能運作的機器。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B106","t":"理論上的"},{"w":"applied","pos":"adj.","def":"used in practical ways rather than just studied","cn":"應用的","s":"She studies ________ science, so she spends more time building devices than reading old theories.","zh":"她唸的是應用科學,所以她花更多時間製作裝置,而不是閱讀舊理論。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B107","t":"應用"},{"w":"scientific","pos":"adj.","def":"connected with science","cn":"科學的","s":"Faraday's ________ work on electricity was brilliant, although he left school at the age of thirteen.","zh":"法拉第在電學方面的科學研究非常傑出,雖然他十三歲就離開了學校。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B108","t":"科學"},{"w":"technological","pos":"adj.","def":"connected with technology","cn":"科技的;技術的","s":"Every ________ change creates new jobs, but it also makes some old skills less useful.","zh":"每一次科技變革都創造新工作,但它也讓一些舊技能變得較不實用。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B109","t":"科技"},{"w":"develop","pos":"v.","def":"to create or improve something over time","cn":"開發;發展","s":"Engineers ________ a safer lamp for miners, and it saved thousands of lives in the following years.","zh":"工程師們開發出一種給礦工用的更安全的燈,而它在隨後幾年拯救了數千條人命。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B110","t":"開發"},{"w":"extend","pos":"v.","def":"to make something longer or larger","cn":"延伸;擴大","s":"The company plans to ________ the railway line to the coast, so tourists can visit the beach more easily.","zh":"公司計劃把鐵路線延伸到海岸,讓遊客能更方便地前往海灘。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B111","t":"延伸"},{"w":"by-product","pos":"n.","def":"something extra produced while making something else","cn":"副產品","s":"Coal gas was a ________ of making coke, and soon it was used to light streets across the city.","zh":"煤氣是製造焦炭的副產品,而很快它就被用來點亮全城的街道。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B112","t":"副產品"},{"w":"side effect","pos":"n.","def":"an extra and usually bad result of something","cn":"副作用","s":"Pollution was a serious ______ ______ of industry, but many factory owners simply ignored it.","zh":"污染是工業一項嚴重的副作用,但許多工廠老闆根本不予理會。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B113","t":"副作用"},{"w":"downside","pos":"n.","def":"a disadvantage","cn":"缺點;壞處","s":"The ________ of living near the station is the noise, but it is very convenient for getting to work.","zh":"住在車站附近的缺點是噪音,但上班非常方便。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B114","t":"缺點"},{"w":"wealth","pos":"n.","def":"a large amount of money or property","cn":"財富","s":"Industry created great ________ for factory owners, while most workers stayed poor for many years.","zh":"工業為工廠老闆創造了巨大的財富,而大多數工人多年來仍然貧窮。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B115","t":"財富"},{"w":"trade","pos":"n.","def":"the buying and selling of goods","cn":"貿易","s":"________ between Britain and India grew quickly, and ships carried cotton and tea across the oceans.","zh":"英國和印度之間的貿易迅速成長,而船隻載運棉花和茶葉橫越大洋。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B116","t":"貿易"},{"w":"import","pos":"v.","def":"to bring goods into a country from abroad","cn":"進口","s":"Britain had to ________ most of its cotton, because the plant could not grow in its cold climate.","zh":"英國必須進口大部分棉花,因為這種植物無法在它寒冷的氣候中生長。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B117","t":"進口"},{"w":"tariff","pos":"n.","def":"a tax on goods coming into a country","cn":"關稅","s":"The government added a ________ on foreign steel, so local steel companies could compete more easily.","zh":"政府對外國鋼鐵加徵關稅,好讓本地鋼鐵公司更容易競爭。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B118","t":"關稅"},{"w":"rate","pos":"n.","def":"the speed or frequency of something","cn":"速度;比率","s":"New railways were built at an amazing ________, and by 1850 most big towns had a station.","zh":"新鐵路以驚人的速度興建,而到了1850年大多數大城鎮都有車站。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B119","t":"速度"},{"w":"figure","pos":"n.","def":"a number, especially in official information","cn":"數字;數據","s":"The ________ for car sales rose again this year, but more people are now choosing electric cars.","zh":"今年汽車銷售的數字又上升了,但現在更多人選擇電動車。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B120","t":"數字"},{"w":"quantity","pos":"n.","def":"an amount or number of something","cn":"數量","s":"Factories could make a huge ________ of nails every day, so building houses became cheaper.","zh":"工廠每天能製造大量的釘子,所以蓋房子變得更便宜。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B121","t":"量"},{"w":"velocity","pos":"n.","def":"the speed of something in a particular direction","cn":"速度","s":"The train reached a ________ of 100 kilometres an hour, and passengers were both excited and afraid.","zh":"火車達到每小時100公里的速度,而乘客們既興奮又害怕。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B122","t":"速度"},{"w":"gravity","pos":"n.","def":"the force that pulls things towards the earth","cn":"重力;地心引力","s":"Newton wondered why apples always fall down, and his ideas about ________ changed science and engineering forever.","zh":"牛頓好奇蘋果為什麼總是往下掉,而他關於重力的想法永遠改變了科學和工程。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B123","t":"重力"},{"w":"kinetic","pos":"adj.","def":"connected with movement","cn":"動力的;運動的","s":"The water wheel turned the ________ energy of the river into power, so the mill could grind grain.","zh":"水車把河流的動能轉化為動力,所以磨坊可以磨穀物。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B124","t":"動"},{"w":"biological","pos":"adj.","def":"connected with living things","cn":"生物的","s":"Pasteur studied ________ processes like milk going sour, and his work made food much safer.","zh":"巴斯德研究牛奶變酸這類生物過程,而他的研究讓食物安全許多。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B125","t":"生物"},{"w":"compound","pos":"n.","def":"a substance made of two or more elements","cn":"化合物","s":"Water is a ________ of hydrogen and oxygen, but each of these gases behaves very differently alone.","zh":"水是氫和氧的化合物,但這兩種氣體單獨存在時的性質非常不同。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B126","t":"化合物"},{"w":"composition","pos":"n.","def":"the parts or substances that something is made of","cn":"成分;組成","s":"Scientists studied the ________ of the metal, and they found that a little carbon made it much stronger.","zh":"科學家研究這種金屬的成分,而他們發現少量的碳讓它堅固許多。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B127","t":"成分"},{"w":"fraction","pos":"n.","def":"a small part of something","cn":"一小部分","s":"The new machine used only a ________ of the coal, so the factory saved a lot of money every year.","zh":"新機器只用了一小部分的煤,所以工廠每年省下很多錢。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B128","t":"一小部分"},{"w":"proof","pos":"n.","def":"facts that show something is true","cn":"證據;證明","s":"The inventor needed ________ that he had the idea first, so he showed the court his dated notebooks.","zh":"發明家需要證據證明是他先有這個點子的,所以他向法庭出示了標有日期的筆記本。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B129","t":"證據"},{"w":"counterargument","pos":"n.","def":"an argument against another argument","cn":"反論;反駁論點","s":"Write one ________ in your essay, and then explain why you still believe your own view is stronger.","zh":"在你的文章中寫出一個反駁論點,然後解釋為什麼你仍然認為自己的觀點比較有力。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B130","t":"反駁論點"},{"w":"simplicity","pos":"n.","def":"the quality of being easy to understand or use","cn":"簡單;簡潔","s":"The bicycle became popular because of its ________, and almost anyone could learn to ride it in a day.","zh":"腳踏車因為它的簡單而受歡迎,而幾乎任何人都能在一天內學會騎。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B131","t":"簡單"},{"w":"covert","pos":"adj.","def":"secret or hidden","cn":"祕密的;隱蔽的","s":"Some companies used ________ methods to copy foreign machines, while others paid for the right to use them.","zh":"有些公司用祕密的手段仿造外國機器,而其他公司則付費取得使用權。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B132","t":"祕密的"},{"w":"noticeable","pos":"adj.","def":"easy to see or notice","cn":"明顯的","s":"There was a ________ drop in pollution after the factory closed, and people could see the stars again.","zh":"工廠關閉後污染有了明顯的下降,而人們又能看見星星了。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B133","t":"明顯的"},{"w":"measurable","pos":"adj.","def":"large enough to be measured","cn":"可衡量的;顯著的","s":"Street lights led to a ________ fall in crime, so other towns quickly installed them too.","zh":"路燈帶來了可衡量的犯罪率下降,所以其他城鎮也很快裝設了路燈。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B134","t":"可衡量的"},{"w":"restructure","pos":"v.","def":"to organise a company or system in a new way","cn":"重組;改組","s":"The car company had to ________ after losing money, and several factories were closed or sold.","zh":"這家汽車公司虧損後不得不重組,而好幾間工廠被關閉或出售。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B135","t":"重組"},{"w":"reorganise","pos":"v.","def":"to arrange something in a new way","cn":"重新安排;改組","s":"Henry Ford decided to ________ his factory around a moving line, so each worker did only one simple task.","zh":"亨利·福特決定圍繞著移動生產線重新安排他的工廠,所以每位工人只做一項簡單的工作。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B136","t":"重新安排"},{"w":"introduce","pos":"v.","def":"to bring something into use for the first time","cn":"引進;推出","s":"The city ________ electric trams in 1900, and people could travel across town for a few pennies.","zh":"這座城市在1900年引進了電車,而人們只要幾便士就能橫越城鎮。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B137","t":"引進"},{"w":"launch","pos":"v.","def":"to start selling a new product","cn":"推出;發行","s":"The company will ________ its new electric bike next month, but the price has not been announced yet.","zh":"這家公司下個月將推出新款電動腳踏車,但價格還沒有公布。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B138","t":"推出"},{"w":"recession","pos":"n.","def":"a period when the economy is doing badly","cn":"經濟衰退","s":"Many factories closed during the ________, and thousands of workers had to look for new jobs.","zh":"許多工廠在經濟衰退期間關閉,而數千名工人必須另找工作。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B139","t":"經濟衰退"},{"w":"boom","pos":"n.","def":"a period of fast economic growth","cn":"繁榮期;熱潮","s":"There was a railway ________ in the 1840s, and thousands of people invested their savings in new lines.","zh":"1840年代出現了一股鐵路熱潮,而成千上萬的人把積蓄投資在新路線上。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B140","t":"熱潮"},{"w":"slump","pos":"n.","def":"a sudden fall in prices or business","cn":"暴跌;不景氣","s":"After the ________ in cotton prices, many mill owners lost everything, and their workers lost their jobs.","zh":"棉花價格暴跌之後,許多工廠主失去了一切,而他們的工人也丟了工作。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B141","t":"暴跌"},{"w":"downturn","pos":"n.","def":"a fall in business or economic activity","cn":"下滑;衰退","s":"The ________ in steel sales hit the town hard, so the council started training people for other work.","zh":"鋼鐵銷售的下滑重創了這個小鎮,所以議會開始培訓人們從事其他工作。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B142","t":"下滑"},{"w":"inflation","pos":"n.","def":"a general rise in prices","cn":"通貨膨脹","s":"________ has made food much more expensive this year, so my family buys fewer snacks now.","zh":"通貨膨脹讓今年的食物貴了很多,所以我家現在比較少買零食。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B143","t":"通貨膨脹"},{"w":"benefactor","pos":"n.","def":"a person who gives money to help others","cn":"捐助者;恩人","s":"A rich ________ paid for the town's first public library, and workers could borrow books for free.","zh":"一位富有的捐助者出資興建了小鎮的第一座公共圖書館,而工人們可以免費借書。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B144","t":"捐助者"},{"w":"philanthropist","pos":"n.","def":"a rich person who gives money to help people","cn":"慈善家","s":"Andrew Carnegie made a fortune from steel, but he became a ________ and gave most of it away.","zh":"安德魯·卡內基靠鋼鐵賺了大錢,但他成為一位慈善家並把大部分財富捐了出去。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B145","t":"慈善家"},{"w":"consumerism","pos":"n.","def":"the idea that buying lots of goods is good","cn":"消費主義","s":"Cheap factory goods led to ________, and today many people buy things they do not really need.","zh":"便宜的工廠商品導致了消費主義,而今天許多人購買並非真正需要的東西。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B146","t":"消費主義"},{"w":"conglomerate","pos":"n.","def":"a large company made of many different businesses","cn":"企業集團","s":"The ________ owns car factories, hotels and a bank, so its decisions affect millions of people.","zh":"這家企業集團擁有汽車工廠、飯店和一家銀行,所以它的決策影響數百萬人。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B147","t":"企業集團"},{"w":"dividend","pos":"n.","def":"a share of a company's profit paid to its owners","cn":"股利;股息","s":"The railway company paid a large ________ every year, so many middle-class families bought its shares.","zh":"鐵路公司每年都發放豐厚的股利,所以許多中產階級家庭買了它的股票。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B148","t":"股利"},{"w":"shareholder","pos":"n.","def":"a person who owns part of a company","cn":"股東","s":"Every ________ can vote at the annual meeting, but the biggest owners usually make the decisions.","zh":"每位股東都可以在年度大會上投票,但通常是最大的股東做決定。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B149","t":"股東"},{"w":"leisure","pos":"n.","def":"free time when you are not working","cn":"閒暇;休閒","s":"Workers had very little ________ in the 1800s, but later laws gave them Saturday afternoons off.","zh":"1800年代的工人幾乎沒有閒暇時間,但後來的法律讓他們週六下午可以休息。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B150","t":"閒暇"},{"w":"recreation","pos":"n.","def":"activities done for fun when you are not working","cn":"娛樂;消遣","s":"Cheap train tickets made seaside trips a popular form of ________, and workers' families loved the beach.","zh":"便宜的火車票讓海邊旅遊成為一種受歡迎的消遣,而勞工家庭很喜歡海灘。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B151","t":"消遣"},{"w":"luxury","pos":"n.","def":"something expensive that you enjoy but do not need","cn":"奢侈品","s":"A car was a ________ in 1910, but today most families in Taiwan own at least one scooter.","zh":"在1910年汽車是奢侈品,但今天台灣大多數家庭至少擁有一台機車。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B152","t":"奢侈品"},{"w":"modernity","pos":"n.","def":"the quality of being modern","cn":"現代性;現代化","s":"Tall glass towers became a symbol of ________, while old wooden houses were slowly knocked down.","zh":"高聳的玻璃大樓成為現代化的象徵,而老舊的木屋則慢慢被拆除。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B153","t":"現代化"},{"w":"unconventional","pos":"adj.","def":"very different from the usual way","cn":"不落俗套的;非傳統的","s":"Her ________ design used bamboo instead of steel, but it was strong enough to carry a small car.","zh":"她非傳統的設計用竹子取代鋼材,但它堅固到足以承載一輛小汽車。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B154","t":"非傳統的"},{"w":"trailblazer","pos":"n.","def":"a person who is the first to do something new","cn":"開拓者;先驅","s":"Ada Lovelace was a ________ in computing, because she wrote programs before modern computers even existed.","zh":"愛達·勒芙蕾絲是電腦領域的開拓者,因為她在現代電腦存在之前就寫出了程式。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B155","t":"開拓者"},{"w":"mastermind","pos":"n.","def":"a very clever person who plans something complex","cn":"策劃者;幕後主腦","s":"Brunel was the ________ behind the Great Western Railway, and he also designed huge iron ships.","zh":"布魯內爾是大西部鐵路背後的策劃者,而他也設計了巨大的鐵船。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B156","t":"策劃者"},{"w":"brilliance","pos":"n.","def":"great intelligence or skill","cn":"才華;卓越","s":"Everyone admired the ________ of her idea, but it took ten years before anyone would pay to build it.","zh":"大家都欽佩她想法中的才華,但過了十年才有人願意出錢把它造出來。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B157","t":"才華"},{"w":"observation","pos":"n.","def":"the act of watching something carefully","cn":"觀察","s":"Careful ________ of boiling water gave him an idea, and he started to experiment with steam power.","zh":"對沸水的仔細觀察給了他一個點子,而他開始實驗蒸汽動力。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B158","t":"觀察"},{"w":"measurement","pos":"n.","def":"a size or amount found by measuring","cn":"測量;尺寸","s":"Every part needed an exact ________, or the machine would not fit together properly at the end.","zh":"每個零件都需要精確的尺寸,否則機器最後就無法正確組裝。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B159","t":"尺寸"},{"w":"intellectual property","pos":"n.phr.","def":"ideas and inventions that legally belong to their creator","cn":"智慧財產","s":"Companies protect their ______ ______ with patents, so others cannot copy their inventions for free.","zh":"公司用專利保護他們的智慧財產,讓別人無法免費抄襲他們的發明。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B160","t":"智慧財產"},{"w":"litigation","pos":"n.","def":"the process of taking a case to court","cn":"訴訟","s":"The two inventors were in ________ for years, and the lawyers earned more money than either of them.","zh":"這兩位發明家打了好幾年的官司,而律師賺的錢比他們任何一方都多。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B161","t":"官司"},{"w":"rightful","pos":"adj.","def":"legally or morally correct","cn":"合法的;應有的","s":"The court decided she was the ________ owner of the patent, so the company had to pay her.","zh":"法院判定她是這項專利的合法擁有者,所以那家公司必須付錢給她。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B162","t":"合法"},{"w":"overheads","pos":"n.","def":"regular business costs such as rent and electricity","cn":"經常性開支;營運費用","s":"The shop's ________ were too high, so the owner moved to a smaller place outside the city centre.","zh":"這家店的營運費用太高,所以老闆搬到市中心外一個較小的地方。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B163","t":"營運費用"},{"w":"retail","pos":"n.","def":"the sale of goods to the public in shops","cn":"零售","s":"My cousin works in ________, and she says weekends before Chinese New Year are the busiest time.","zh":"我表姊在零售業工作,而她說農曆新年前的週末是最忙的時候。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B164","t":"零售"},{"w":"merchandise","pos":"n.","def":"goods that are bought and sold","cn":"商品;貨品","s":"The new department store displayed its ________ in large glass windows, and crowds stopped to look.","zh":"新的百貨公司在大玻璃櫥窗中展示它的商品,而人群停下來觀看。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B165","t":"商品"},{"w":"marketplace","pos":"n.","def":"the world of buying and selling","cn":"市場","s":"Cheap goods from factories filled the ________, so small craftsmen found it hard to make a living.","zh":"工廠生產的便宜商品充斥市場,所以小手工業者很難維生。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B166","t":"市場"},{"w":"rivalry","pos":"n.","def":"competition between people or groups","cn":"競爭;對抗","s":"The ________ between Edison and Tesla was famous, and both men claimed their system was safer.","zh":"愛迪生和特斯拉之間的競爭很有名,而兩人都宣稱自己的系統比較安全。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B167","t":"競爭"},{"w":"hegemony","pos":"n.","def":"control by one powerful country or group over others","cn":"霸權","s":"Britain held industrial ________ for most of the 1800s, but by 1900 America produced more steel.","zh":"英國在1800年代大部分時間握有工業霸權,但到了1900年美國生產的鋼鐵更多。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B168","t":"霸權"},{"w":"superpower","pos":"n.","def":"an extremely powerful country","cn":"超級強國","s":"After the war, the country became a ________, and its factories made goods for the whole world.","zh":"戰後這個國家成為超級強國,而它的工廠為全世界製造商品。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B169","t":"超級強國"},{"w":"geopolitical","pos":"adj.","def":"connected with how geography affects politics between countries","cn":"地緣政治的","s":"Coal and oil had huge ________ importance, so countries fought to control the regions where they were found.","zh":"煤和石油具有巨大的地緣政治重要性,所以各國爭奪控制出產它們的地區。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B170","t":"地緣政治"},{"w":"colony","pos":"n.","def":"a country or area controlled by another country","cn":"殖民地","s":"India was a British ________ at that time, and much of its cotton was sent to factories in England.","zh":"印度當時是英國的殖民地,而它的大部分棉花被送到英格蘭的工廠。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B171","t":"殖民地"},{"w":"imperialism","pos":"n.","def":"a system in which a powerful country controls others","cn":"帝國主義","s":"Industry and ________ grew together, because factories needed raw materials from other parts of the world.","zh":"工業和帝國主義一起成長,因為工廠需要來自世界其他地方的原料。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B172","t":"帝國主義"},{"w":"emancipation","pos":"n.","def":"the act of giving people freedom","cn":"解放","s":"The ________ of enslaved people was a huge step, but freed workers still faced unfair treatment for decades.","zh":"被奴役者的解放是重大的一步,但獲得自由的勞工在數十年間仍遭受不公平對待。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B173","t":"解放"},{"w":"liberation","pos":"n.","def":"the act of freeing someone from control","cn":"解放;解脫","s":"The washing machine meant a kind of ________ for women, since they no longer spent a whole day washing clothes.","zh":"洗衣機對女性來說意味著一種解放,因為她們不再花一整天洗衣服。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B174","t":"解放"},{"w":"humanitarian","pos":"adj.","def":"connected with helping people who are suffering","cn":"人道主義的","s":"The doctor did ________ work in the slums, and he treated poor patients without asking for money.","zh":"那位醫生在貧民窟從事人道工作,而他免費為貧窮病人看病。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B175","t":"人道"},{"w":"virtue","pos":"n.","def":"a good quality in a person's character","cn":"美德","s":"Victorians saw hard work as a ________, so they believed poor people should simply work harder.","zh":"維多利亞時代的人視勤奮為一種美德,所以他們認為窮人只要更努力工作就好。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B176","t":"美德"},{"w":"corruption","pos":"n.","def":"dishonest behaviour by people in power","cn":"貪腐;腐敗","s":"There was ________ in the railway company, because some managers secretly took money from builders.","zh":"鐵路公司裡有貪腐問題,因為一些經理私下收取營造商的錢。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B177","t":"貪腐"},{"w":"fraud","pos":"n.","def":"the crime of tricking people to get money","cn":"詐欺","s":"The banker was arrested for ________, because he had sold shares in a railway that did not exist.","zh":"那名銀行家因詐欺被捕,因為他賣了一條根本不存在的鐵路的股份。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B178","t":"詐欺"},{"w":"lawful","pos":"adj.","def":"allowed by law","cn":"合法的","s":"Workers wanted a ________ way to protest, so they asked the government to allow trade unions.","zh":"工人們想要一個合法的抗議方式,所以他們要求政府允許成立工會。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B179","t":"合法的"},{"w":"illicit","pos":"adj.","def":"not allowed by law or rules","cn":"非法的;違禁的","s":"Some sailors ran an ________ trade in stolen goods, but the port police finally caught them.","zh":"有些水手從事贓物的非法交易,但港口警察最終抓到了他們。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B180","t":"非法"},{"w":"injury","pos":"n.","def":"physical harm to the body","cn":"傷害;受傷","s":"A serious ________ meant a worker could lose his job, and his family might have nothing to eat.","zh":"嚴重的受傷意味著工人可能丟掉工作,而他的家人可能會沒東西吃。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B181","t":"受傷"},{"w":"mishap","pos":"n.","def":"a small accident or bad luck","cn":"小意外;不幸事故","s":"There was a ________ during the demonstration, because the machine caught fire, but nobody was hurt.","zh":"示範過程中發生了一個小意外,因為機器起火了,但沒有人受傷。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B182","t":"小意外"},{"w":"tragedy","pos":"n.","def":"a very sad event, often with death","cn":"悲劇;慘劇","s":"The mine disaster was a terrible ________, and the town still holds a memorial every year.","zh":"那場礦災是一場可怕的悲劇,而小鎮至今每年仍舉行追悼會。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B183","t":"悲劇"},{"w":"leap","pos":"n.","def":"a sudden big change or improvement","cn":"躍進;飛躍","s":"The telephone was a great ________ forward, because people could hear each other's voices across countries.","zh":"電話是一大躍進,因為人們能跨國聽見彼此的聲音。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B184","t":"躍進"},{"w":"stride","pos":"n.","def":"an important step forward in progress","cn":"進展;大步","s":"Medicine made huge ________ in the 1800s, and many common diseases could finally be prevented or cured.","zh":"醫學在1800年代取得了巨大的進展,而許多常見疾病終於可以預防或治癒。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B185","t":"進展"},{"w":"pattern","pos":"n.","def":"a regular way in which something happens","cn":"模式;規律","s":"Historians noticed a ________ in the strikes, because they usually happened when food prices went up.","zh":"歷史學家注意到罷工中的一種規律,因為它們通常在糧價上漲時發生。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B186","t":"規律"},{"w":"uptake","pos":"n.","def":"the rate at which people start using something","cn":"採用率;接受程度","s":"The ________ of electric cars has been slow in some areas, because there are not enough charging stations.","zh":"在某些地區電動車的採用率一直很慢,因為充電站不夠多。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B187","t":"採用率"},{"w":"societal","pos":"adj.","def":"connected with society","cn":"社會的","s":"The car caused huge ________ changes, since people could live far from work and still arrive on time.","zh":"汽車引起了巨大的社會變化,因為人們可以住得離工作地點很遠又仍準時到達。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B188","t":"社會"},{"w":"fiscal","pos":"adj.","def":"connected with government money and taxes","cn":"財政的","s":"The government had a ________ problem after building so many railways, so it raised taxes on tobacco.","zh":"政府興建了這麼多鐵路後出現財政問題,所以它提高了菸草稅。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B189","t":"財政"},{"w":"monetary","pos":"adj.","def":"connected with money","cn":"貨幣的;金錢的","s":"The inventor received no ________ reward for his idea, but he was proud that it helped so many people.","zh":"發明家沒有因為他的點子得到任何金錢報酬,但他很自豪它幫助了那麼多人。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B190","t":"金錢"},{"w":"urban","pos":"adj.","def":"connected with towns and cities","cn":"城市的;都市的","s":"________ areas grew very quickly during the Industrial Revolution, but small villages lost many young people.","zh":"都市地區在工業革命期間成長得非常快,但小村莊失去了許多年輕人。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B191","t":"都市"},{"w":"suburban","pos":"adj.","def":"connected with the areas around a city where people live","cn":"郊區的","s":"The new railway created ________ towns, and office workers could live in quiet streets with gardens.","zh":"新鐵路創造了郊區城鎮,而上班族可以住在有花園的安靜街道上。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B192","t":"郊區"},{"w":"mobility","pos":"n.","def":"the ability to move or travel easily","cn":"流動性;移動能力","s":"Cars gave people much more ________, so they could take jobs in other towns without moving house.","zh":"汽車給了人們更多的移動能力,所以他們不必搬家就能在其他城鎮工作。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B193","t":"移動能力"},{"w":"plentiful","pos":"adj.","def":"existing in large amounts","cn":"充足的;豐富的","s":"Coal was ________ in northern England, so many factories were built close to the mines to save money.","zh":"英格蘭北部的煤很豐富,所以許多工廠都蓋在礦場附近以節省成本。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B194","t":"豐富"},{"w":"workable","pos":"adj.","def":"able to be used successfully","cn":"可行的;可運作的","s":"His first plan was not ________, but after many changes the engine finally ran without stopping.","zh":"他的第一個計畫並不可行,但經過多次修改後,引擎終於能不停地運轉。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B195","t":"可行"},{"w":"inexhaustible","pos":"adj.","def":"so large that it can never be used up","cn":"取之不盡的","s":"People once thought coal was ________, but now we know that it will run out one day.","zh":"人們曾經以為煤是取之不盡的,但現在我們知道它總有一天會用完。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B196","t":"取之不盡的"},{"w":"wasteful","pos":"adj.","def":"using more than is needed","cn":"浪費的","s":"Old engines were very ________, because most of the heat escaped instead of moving the machine.","zh":"舊引擎非常浪費,因為大部分的熱都散失了,而不是用來推動機器。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B197","t":"浪費"},{"w":"waste","pos":"n.","def":"material that is thrown away after use","cn":"廢棄物;垃圾","s":"Factories dumped their ________ into nearby rivers, so the water turned black and smelled terrible in summer.","zh":"工廠把廢棄物傾倒進附近的河裡,所以河水變黑,夏天時更是臭氣沖天。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B198","t":"廢棄物"},{"w":"tycoon","pos":"n.","def":"a very rich and powerful businessperson","cn":"大亨;巨頭","s":"The oil ________ owned dozens of companies, but he started his career as a poor office clerk.","zh":"那位石油大亨擁有數十家公司,但他的職業生涯是從一名貧窮的辦公室職員開始的。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B199","t":"大亨"},{"w":"magnate","pos":"n.","def":"a rich and powerful person in a particular industry","cn":"(某行業的)巨頭;大亨","s":"The railway ________ built a huge mansion, while the workers who laid his tracks lived in tents.","zh":"那位鐵路巨頭蓋了一座巨大的豪宅,而為他鋪設鐵軌的工人卻住在帳篷裡。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B200","t":"巨頭"},{"w":"full steam ahead","pos":"phr.","def":"moving forward with full energy and speed","cn":"全速前進","s":"Once the bank gave us the loan, it was ______ ______ ______ with the project, and we finished it in six months.","zh":"銀行一借給我們貸款,這個計畫就全速前進,而我們在六個月內就完成了。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P1","t":"全速前進"},{"w":"run out of steam","pos":"v.phr.","def":"to lose energy or enthusiasm","cn":"失去動力;精疲力盡","s":"I started my essay with lots of ideas, but I ______ ______ ______ ______ after the first page and had to take a break.","zh":"我一開始寫文章時有很多點子,但寫完第一頁後我就失去動力,只好休息一下。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P2","t":"失去動力"},{"w":"pick up steam","pos":"v.phr.","def":"to become stronger, faster or more popular","cn":"逐漸加速;勢頭增強","s":"The campaign for shorter working hours began slowly, but it ______ ______ ______ when newspapers reported on child workers.","zh":"爭取縮短工時的運動起初進展緩慢,但在報紙報導童工之後就聲勢漸增。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P3","t":"聲勢漸增"},{"w":"reinvent the wheel","pos":"v.phr.","def":"to waste time making something that already exists","cn":"重複發明輪子;做白工","s":"We do not need to ______ ______ ______, because there is already a good app for planning group projects.","zh":"我們不需要重複發明輪子,因為已經有一個很好的應用程式可以規劃小組作業。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P4","t":"重複發明輪子"},{"w":"necessity is the mother of invention","pos":"phr.","def":"people invent things when they really need them","cn":"需要為發明之母","s":"The campers had no pot, so they cooked rice in a bamboo tube, which shows that ______ ______ ______ ______ ______ ______.","zh":"露營的人沒有鍋子,所以他們用竹筒煮飯,這說明了需要為發明之母。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P5","t":"需要為發明之母"},{"w":"back to the drawing board","pos":"phr.","def":"time to start planning again after a failure","cn":"從頭再來;重新規劃","s":"Our paper bridge collapsed under the first book, so it was ______ ______ ______ ______ ______ for our team.","zh":"我們的紙橋在放上第一本書時就垮了,所以我們這組只好從頭再來。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P6","t":"從頭再來"},{"w":"ahead of one's time","pos":"adj.phr.","def":"having ideas too new for the people of that time","cn":"超越時代的","s":"Da Vinci was ______ ______ ______ ______, because he drew helicopters and tanks hundreds of years before they were built.","zh":"達文西是超越他那個時代的人,因為他在直升機和坦克被造出來的數百年前就畫出了它們。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P7","t":"超越他那個時代的"},{"w":"turning point","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a moment when a big change happens","cn":"轉捩點","s":"Winning the science fair was a ______ ______ in her life, and she decided to become an engineer.","zh":"贏得科展是她人生的轉捩點,而她決定要成為一名工程師。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P8","t":"轉捩點"},{"w":"the daily grind","pos":"n.phr.","def":"boring and tiring work that you do every day","cn":"日復一日的苦差事","s":"Factory workers faced ______ ______ ______ of twelve-hour shifts, and they rarely had time to rest.","zh":"工廠工人面對著每天十二小時輪班的日常苦差事,而他們很少有時間休息。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P9","t":"日常苦差事"},{"w":"come up with","pos":"v.phr.","def":"to think of an idea or plan","cn":"想出","s":"Our team had to ______ ______ ______ a way to clean the beach, and we designed a simple floating net.","zh":"我們這組必須想出一個清理海灘的方法,而我們設計了一個簡單的浮動網子。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P10","t":"想出"},{"w":"put into practice","pos":"v.phr.","def":"to start using an idea or plan in real life","cn":"付諸實行","s":"The school ______ ______ ______ the new recycling plan last month, and the amount of rubbish has already dropped.","zh":"學校上個月把新的回收計畫付諸實行,而垃圾量已經減少了。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P11","t":"付諸實行"},{"w":"in the pipeline","pos":"adj.phr.","def":"being planned or developed and coming soon","cn":"籌備中;即將推出","s":"A new train line to the airport is ______ ______ ______, but it will not open until 2030.","zh":"一條通往機場的新鐵路線正在籌備中,但它要到2030年才會通車。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P12","t":"籌備中"},{"w":"on the right track","pos":"adj.phr.","def":"doing something in a way that will lead to success","cn":"方向正確","s":"My teacher said my project was ______ ______ ______ ______, so I just need to add more data.","zh":"老師說我的專題方向正確,所以我只需要再加入更多數據。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P13","t":"方向正確"},{"w":"go off the rails","pos":"v.phr.","def":"to start behaving badly or failing","cn":"出軌;失控","s":"The project began to ______ ______ ______ ______ when the leader left, and nobody knew what to do next.","zh":"領導者離開後這個計畫開始失控,而沒有人知道接下來該做什麼。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P14","t":"失控"},{"w":"run like clockwork","pos":"v.phr.","def":"to happen exactly as planned without problems","cn":"運作順暢;井然有序","s":"The school sports day ______ ______ ______, because the teachers had planned every detail weeks before.","zh":"學校運動會進行得井然有序,因為老師們好幾週前就規劃好了每個細節。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P15","t":"進行得井然有序"},{"w":"the best thing since sliced bread","pos":"n.phr.","def":"an excellent new invention or idea (humorous)","cn":"最棒的新發明","s":"My grandma thinks video calls are ______ ______ ______ ______ ______ ______, because she can see her grandchildren every day.","zh":"我奶奶覺得視訊通話是有史以來最棒的發明,因為她每天都能看到孫子們。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P16","t":"有史以來最棒的發明"},{"w":"the brainchild of","pos":"n.phr.","def":"an idea or invention created by a particular person","cn":"……的心血結晶","s":"The underground railway was ______ ______ ______ a lawyer named Charles Pearson, but he died before it opened.","zh":"地下鐵路是一位名叫查爾斯·皮爾森的律師的心血結晶,但他在通車前就去世了。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P17","t":"心血結晶"},{"w":"make ends meet","pos":"v.phr.","def":"to have just enough money to live","cn":"勉強維持生計","s":"Many families could not ______ ______ ______ on one wage, so the children also had to work in the mills.","zh":"許多家庭靠一份工資無法維持生計,所以孩子們也必須到工廠工作。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P18","t":"無法維持生計"},{"w":"think outside the box","pos":"v.phr.","def":"to think in a new and creative way","cn":"跳脫框架思考","s":"To solve the problem, we had to ______ ______ ______ ______, so we used old bottles to build a greenhouse.","zh":"為了解決問題,我們必須跳脫框架思考,所以我們用舊瓶子蓋了一座溫室。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P19","t":"跳脫框架思考"},{"w":"set the wheels in motion","pos":"v.phr.","def":"to start a process","cn":"啟動;開始進行","s":"The mayor ______ ______ ______ ______ ______ for a new bike lane, and work will start next spring.","zh":"市長啟動了新自行車道的計畫,而工程將在明年春天開始。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P20","t":"啟動了"}]};
